<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="EXO" style="id">Exodus</book>
  <para style="h">Exodus</para>
  <para style="toc1">Exodus</para>
  <para style="toc2">Exodus</para>
  <para style="mt">Exodus</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jakoba ruala Aigupta rama Israela fa, mahni nupui fanau nên ṭheuhva chhukte hming chu hêng hi a ni:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Reubena te, Simeona te, Levia te, Juda te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Isakara te, Zebuluna te, Benjamina te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Dana te, Naftalia te, Gada leh Asera te.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Israela thlahte chu a lu nungin sawmsarih an ni. Josefa chu Aigupta ramah a lo awm tawh sa a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Josefa leh a unaute chu an thi a, an hun laia mite pawh an thi fai vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israela fate chu nasa takin an lo pung a, an chak deuh deuh va, ram pumah an khat ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aigupta ramah Josefa hre lo lal thar a lo awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A mite hnênah, “Israel fate hi kan aiin an tamin an chak zâwk mai dâwn alâwm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Indo awm hlauh se kan hmêlmate an thlâwp ang a, min bei ang a, ram ata hi min chhuahsan mai dah ang e; ti rawh u, finrâwl chhuahin an pun zêl lohna tûr kawng i ngaihtuah teh ang u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tichuan, rim taka chhawrtu tûr mi an ruat a. Farawa kudam hmun atân Pithom te, Ramases khuate an siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />An chhawr rim poh leh an pung chak a, an darh zau ting mai a ni. Aigupta mite tân hlauhawm tham an lo ni ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aigupta mite chuan rim lehzualin an chhawr ta a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />hlum an siamtîr a, an rawhchantîr a; lovah te an chhawr a, thawh tûr chi tinrêng hah takin an thawhtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aigupta lal chuan Hebrai-ho nau chhartu Sifraii leh Puaii hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Hebrai nuho nau in chharin mipa a nih chuan that ula, hmeichhia a nih erawh chuan zuah ang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nau chhartute chu Pathian ṭih mi tak an lo ni a, Aigupta lal thupêk ang chuan an ti duh lo va, mipa pawh an zuah ta zêl tho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nau chhartute chu Aigupta lal chuan a ko va, “engtizia nge hetianga thil in tih, mipate pawh in la zuah zêl hi?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nau chhartuten Farawa hnênah chuan, “Hebrai nuhovin Aigupta mi an ang ve lo, nau an awl bîk a, nau chhartu thlen hmain an hring zêl alâwm,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nau chhartute chu Pathianin a tiṭha ta hle a, Israel mite chu an pung chakin an lo tam ta hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Pathian an ṭih avângin nau chhartute pawh chu an chhûngkua an pung ve ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Farawa chuan a khua leh tuite chu thu a pe a, “Mipa fa piang hlim apiang Nail luiah paihsak ula, hmeichhe fa erawh chu zuah ang che u,” a ti vek a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Levia chia mi tlangvâl pakhatin Levia chi bawk nula nupuiah a nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hmeichhia chuan nau a pai a, fapa a hring a. Nau duhawm tak a nih avângin thla thum chhûng chu a thukru a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A thuhrûk reng theih tâk loh hnuah chuan rairuang bâwm a la a, hlum a bel a, alkatra-in a zût phui a, a chhûngah chuan nau chu a dah a, luipui kama rairuang buk zîngah chuan a dah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Engtin nge a awm zêl tih thlîrin hla fêah a farnu chu a ding reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Farawa fanu chu a ṭhuihruaite nên inbual tûrin luiah chuan an chhuk a, lui kamah chuan an kal a, rairuang zînga bâwm dah chu a hmu a; a chhiahhlawh nula chu a lâktîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A han hawng a, nautê a lo ni a; nausên chu a ṭap ta a. A khawngaih ta êm êm a, “Hebrai mi fa a ni phawt mai,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A farnu chuan Farawa fanu hnênah chuan, “Hebrai hmeichhia, nau awm thiam ka va kohsak ang che chu, a awmsak dâwn che nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Farawa fanu chuan, “Va ko ta che,” a ti a. Hmeichhe naupang chuan naute nu chu a ko va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Farawa fanu chuan hetiang hian a lo ti a, “He naute hi hâwn la, min pawmtlei sak rawh; hlawh ka pe ang che,” a ti a. Chu nu chuan nausên chu a la a, a pawm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nau chu a lo ṭhang lian a, Farawa fanu hnênah chuan a hruai a; ani chuan fapaah a lo nei ta a, “Tui aṭanga ka lâk chhuah a nih hi,” tiin a hmingah Mosia a sa a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mosia chu a lo tlangvâl ta a. Ni khat chu a unaute hnênah a va lêng a, an thawh rimzia chu a va hmu a; a unau zînga Hebrai mi pakhat Aigupta miin a lo vua chu a hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lehlam lehlam a han hawi a, tu mahin an hmu lo nia a hriat chuan Aigupta mi chu a that a, ṭiau vaivutah a phûm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A tûkah chuan a va kal leh a, Hebrai mi pahnih hi an lo insual a. A tisual hmasa zâwktu hnênah chuan, “Engtizia nge i unaupa i sual mai le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Tu nge kan chunga rorêla thuneitu atân ruat che? Aigupta mi i thah ang khân min thah i tum elo?” a ti a. Mosia chuan a hlauthâwng ta hle a. “Mi an lo hria a ni phawt mai,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Faraw-an a lo hriat chuan Mosia chu thah a tum ta a. Farawa hmuh loh tûrin Mosia chu a tlân bo ta a; Midian mite ram a va thleng a, tuichhunchhuah bulah a ṭhu chawt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Midian puithiam chuan fanu pasarih a nei a; tui an rawn chawi a, an pa berâm rual in tûr ran tuikuangah an chhûng khat ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Berâmpu dang an lo kal a, an rawn hnawt a. Mosia chuan a lo chhan a; an berâmte chu tui a intîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />An pa Reuela hnên an thlen chuan, “Vawiin chu engtizia nge in va lo thleng hma ve,” a lo ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Anni chuan, “Aigupta mi, mi pakhatin Berâmpuho lakah min chhan a, amah ngeiin tui a chawi a, rante chu tui a pe atin a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A fanute hnênah chuan, “Khawiah nge a awm tâk? Engtizia nge in kalsan mai le? Va ko teh u, chaw te ei ve teh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chu mi hnêna awm chu Mosia chuan a remti ta a. Mosia chu a fanu Zipori nupuiah a neihtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ani chuan fapa a hrinsak a, “Mikhual, ram dang mi ka nih hi,” tiin a hmingah Gersoma a sa a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Rei fe hnuah chuan Aigupta lal chu a thi a; Israel fate chu bawih nihna phurrit avâng chuan an rûm a, ṭanpui dila an au thâwm chu Pathian hnênah a han thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Pathian chuan an rûm chu a lo hria a; Abrahama te, Isaka te, Jakoba te hnêna a thuthlung kha a la hre reng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Pathian chuan Israel fate dinhmun chu a hmu a, a ngaihsak hle a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mosia chuan a puzawn, Midian puithiam Jethroa berâmte chu a vêng a; thlalêr thlang lamah a thlah a; Pathian tlâng, Horeb chu a va thleng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa vântirhkoh chu a hnênah, thingbukah meialhin a rawn inlâr a, a han en chuan thingbuk chu a alh a; mahse, a kâng si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mosia chuan, “He thil mak tak hi ka va en teh rêng ang, engtizia nge thingbuk hi a kan hauh si loh le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />En tûra a va pan chu Lalpa chuan a hmu a, thingbuk aṭang chuan Pathian chuan, “Mosi, Mosi,” a rawn ti a. Ani chuan, “Eng nge ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian chuan, “Lo kal hnai suh, i pheikhawk kha hlîp rawh, i dinna kha hmun thianghlim a ni,” a rawn ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Heti hian a ti bawk, “I pate Pathian ka nih hi: Abrahama Pathian, Isaka Pathian, Jakoba Pathian chu,” tiin. Mosia chuan Pathian a hmu ngam lo va, a hmai a khuh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpa chuan, “Aigupta rama awm, ka mite tuar nasatzia ka hmu reng a ni; chhawrtute avânga an rûm thâwm pawh ka hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aigupta mite kut ata chhan chhuak tûrin tûnah ka lo chhuk a ni; chu ram ata chu ka hruai chhuak ang a, ram ṭha tak, thâwl tak, khawizu leh hnutetuia luang ramah ka hruai dâwn a ni; Kanan mite, Hit mi te, Amor mi te, Periz mi te, Hiv mi te leh Jebus mi te awmna ramah chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ngai teh, Israel fate ṭap thâwm ka hnên a lo thleng a, Aigupta miten an tihnawmnahzia pawh ka hmu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chuvângin, ti rawh, Farawa hnênah ka tîr teh ang che. Ka mi, Israel fate chu Aigupta ram aṭangin i hruai chhuak dâwn nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mosia chuan Pathian hnênah, “Farawa hnêna kal âwm ka ni lo ve, Israel fate Aigupta ram aṭanga hruai chhuak thei tûr pawh ka ni lo ve,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ani chuan, “Ka awmpui zêl dâwn che alâwm; ka mite Aigupta ram aṭanga i hruai chhuah hunah, he tlângah hian Pathian chibai in rawn bûk ang; chu chu ka tîr che a ni tih i hriat chianna tûr chu a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mosian Pathian hnênah, “Israel fate hnênah zu kal ila, ‘in pate Pathian chuan in hnênah min rawn tîr a ni,’ ti ila, ‘A hming eng nge?’ lo ti sela, engtin nge ka chhan ang?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pathianin Mosia hnênah chuan, “AWMA ka ni” a ti a. “Israel fate hnênah chuan, ‘AWMA chuan min tîr a ni,’ ti ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mosia hnênah Pathian chuan, “Israel fate hnênah chuan heti hian i sawi tûr a ni: ‘ Lalpa in pate Pathian, Abrahama Pathian, Isaka Pathian, Jakoba Pathian chuan in hnênah min tîr a ni’ ti ang che. Chu hming chu ka hming a ni kumkhua a, ṭhang lo thar tûr zawng zawng pawhin chutiang chuan min hre tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kal ta la, Israel upate chu ko khâwm la, an hnênah, ‘ Lalpa , in pate Pathian, Abrahama Pathian, Isaka Pathian, Jakoba Pathian chu ka hnênah a inlâr a, ‘Ka hre reng che u alâwm, Aigupta rama an sawisak dân che u hi ka hmu reng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aigupta mite tihduhdahna lak ata Kanan mi te, Hit mi te, Amor mi te, Periz mi te, Hiv mi te leh Jebus mite awmna ram, khawizu leh hnutetuia luang ramah ka hruai ang che u, a ti,’ ti ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka mite chuan i thu an ngaithla ang; nang leh Israel upate chu Aigupta lal hnênah in kal ang a, a hnênah, ‘ Lalpa , Hebrai mite Pathian chu kan hnênah a rawn inlâr a; thlalêrah, ni thum kalah kan Pathian, Lalpa hnêna inthawina hlân tûrin min kaltîr ta che,’ in ti dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aigupta lal chuan a kaltîr phal dâwn lo che u tih ka hre sa a ni, na deuhva kar a ngai dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka kut ka lek ang a, Aigupta mite chu an zînga thil mak tak tak ka tih tûr chuan ka sawisa dâwn a ni. Chumi hnuah chuan in kal a phal ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Aigupta mite chu ka mite hi ka duhsaktîr ang a, in chhuah hunah chuan kut ruakin in chhuak lo vang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />hmeichhia zawng zawngin an ṭhenawmte leh an ina awm vete tangkarua leh rangkachaka siam incheina leh thawmhnaw an dîl ang a, an fanu an fapate chu an chei ang a, chutiang chuan Aigupta mite chu in rawk a ni ngawt dâwn nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mosia chuan a chhâng a, “Ngai teh, ka thu an awih lo vang a, ka aw an ngaithla hek lo vang, ‘ Lalpa chu i hnênah a inlâr ngût lo vang,’ min tihsan mai ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa chuan a hnênah, “I ken kha eng nge ni?” a ti a. “Tiang” tiin a chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Leiah han tlûk teh,” a ti a. Leiah a han tlûk a, rûlah a chang ta mai a; hlauvin Mosia chu a tlânchhia a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Mosia hnênah, “I kutin ban la, a meiah man rawh,” a ti a. A han ban a, a meiah a man a, a kutah chuan tiang a ni leh ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Chutianga i tih chuan an pate Pathian, Abrahama Pathian, Isaka Pathian, Jakoba Pathian chu i hnênah a inlâr ngei a ni tih an hria ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti bawk a, “I kutin i kawrâwm kha zen teh,” a ti a. A han zen a, a phawi leh chuan a kut chu vûr anga vârin a lo phâr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“I kutin i kawrâwm kha zen leh teh,” a ti a. A kawrâwm chu a zen leh a, a han lâk chhuah chuan a lehlam ang chiah a lo ni leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lalpa chuan, “I thu an awih duh lohva, thil mak i tih hmasak an awih duh loh pawhin a hnuhnûng zâwk tal hi an awih ang chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hêng thil mak pahnihte hi an awih duh lohva, i aw an ngaihthlâk duh loh fo chuan, Nail lui tui suak la, leichârah leihbua ang che; lei a thlenah i tui suah chu thisenah a chang ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mosia chuan Lalpa hnênah, “Aw Lalpa , min biak hma pawhin ṭawnghmang thiam mi ka ni lo va, ka ṭawng a bah a, ka dang a âwk bawk a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalpa chuan a chhâng a, “Tu nge mihring kâ hi siamsak? Tu nge a beng tihngawnsaka, ṭawng theih lohtîr? Tu nge tihdelsaka, tihvârsaktu? Kei Lalpa hi ka ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chuvângin, kal mai rawh, i kâ chu ka thuam ang a, sawi tûr ka zirtîr dâwn che nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mosia chuan, “Aw Lalpa , i mi duhzâwng dang tîr mai teh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mosia chungah Lalpa chu a thinur ta hle a, “Levia chi, i u Arona a awm a ni lâwm ni? Ṭawnghmang a thiam hle tih ka hria a ni. Tin, ngai teh, nangmah tâwk tûr chein a lo kal a, a hmuh che chuan a lâwm hle ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A hnênah thu i sawi ang a, sawi tûr i hrilh zêl ang a, I kâ leh a kâ chu ka thuam ang a, in tih tûr chu ka zirtîr zêl ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mipui hnêna i thu sawi chhâwngtuah a ṭang ang a, i tân kâ ang a ni ang a, a tân nang pawh Pathian ang i ni dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />I tiang hi keng la, hei hian thil mak ti ṭhîn ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A puzawn Jethroa hnênah Mosia chu a kal a, a hnênah, “Ka unau, Aigupta rama awmte zu tlawh tûrin khawngaih takin min kaltîr teh,” a ti a. Jethroa chuan Mosia hnênah, “Dam takin zu kal ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Midian ramah Lalpan Mosia hnênah, “Kal la, Aigupta ramah lêt tawh rawh, nangmah thah tumtute kha an thi zo tawh e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mosia chuan a nupui leh a fapate chu sabengtung chungah a chuantîr a, Aigupta ram lamah chuan a kîr ta a. Mosia chuan Pathian tiang kha a keng zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Mosia hnênah, “Aigupta ram i thlen hunah, thil mak ka tihtîr tûr zawng zawng che chu Farawa hmaah ti ang che. Amaherawhchu, ka tiluhlul ang a, ka mite chu a kaltîr mai lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Farawa hnênah chuan heti hian i ti tûr a ni: ‘ Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: Israel chu ka fapa, ka fa tîr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ka fapa chu ka rawngbâwl tûrin kaltîr rawh ka ti che a, i kaltîr duh lo vei a; ngai teh, i fapa, i fa tîr chu ka tihhlumsak ang che, a ti e,’ ti ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, an riahna tûr bûk kawnga an kal lai chuan Lalpa chuan a lo tâwk a, thah a lo tum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Zipori chuan meilung a la a, a fapa serh vun hmâwr chu a tansak a, Mosia malpuiah a tât a, “Thisen lâwm tak pasal i nih hi le,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Mosia nunna chu a zuah ta a. Zipori chuan “Serh tan thu-a thisen chhuah lâwm tak pasal i nih hi,” a ti bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Arona hnênah, “Mosia hmuak tûrin thlalêrah chhuak rawh,” a ti a. A kal ta a, Pathian tlângah chuan a va hmu a, a fâwp a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Mosia chuan Arona hnênah Lalpa tirhna thute chu a hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mosia leh Arona chu an kal a, Israel fate zînga an upate chu an khâwm a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Arona chuan Mosia hnêna Lalpa thu sawi zawng zawng chu a hrilh a; thil makte pawh an hmaah chuan a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Mite chuan an ring a, Lalpa chuan Israel fate chu a hre reng a, an hrehawm tuarte chu a hmu a ni tih an hriat chuan an kûn a, chibai an bûk a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chumi hnuah chuan Mosia leh Arona chu Farawa hnênah an kal a, “ Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian chuan heti hian a ti: ‘thlalêrah ka kût an hman theih nân ka mite hi chhuah rawh,’ a ti e,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Farawa chuan, “ Lalpa in tih chu tu nge maw a niha, a thu awiha Israel-te ka han chhuah tehlul ang le? Lalpa in tih hi ka hre lo ve, Israel-te lah ka chhuah hek lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Anni chuan, “Hebrai mite Pathian chu kan hnênah a rawn inlâr a, ni thum kala hla thlalêrah kan va kal ang a, kan Pathian Lalpa hnênah kan va inthawi ang e; chutilo zawng, hriin emaw, khandaihin emaw mi a rawn hrem dah ang e,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aigupta lal chuan Mosia leh Arona hnênah, “Engtizia nge nangni hian mite hnathawk lai in tihdâwngdah le? Hna thawk leh vat rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Farawa chuan, “Aigupta mite aiin hêng mite hi an tam ta a, hna thawh lohtîr in tum a nih hi,” a ti bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chumi ni ngei chuan Farawa chuan chhawrtute leh Israel zînga hotute chu thu a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Leirawhchan an siam nân buhpâwl pe tawh suh u, anmahni ngeiin zawng chawp rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />An siam tûr bituk zât chu in siamtîr zêl tho tûr a ni; tihtlêmsak suh u, an thatchhiat chhuanlamin, ‘Kan Pathian hnênah inthawi tûrin i kal ang u,’ an ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thawh tûr tam zâwk tuk tûr an ni; dâwngdah hman lovin thawk sela, hetiang thu lawilo hi ngaithla hman suh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chhawrtute leh Israel zînga hotute chu an chhuak a, mite hnênah, “Farawa chuan heti hian a ti: ‘buhpâwl ka pe tawh lo vang che u,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />nangmahniin in zawng chawp ang a, siam tûr tuk zât chu tihtlêmsak in ni hek lo vang,’ a ti,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aigupta ram tinah mite chu buhpâwl zawngin an vâk ta noh noh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chhawrtuho chuan an tur a, “buhpâwl pêk in nih lai ang khân in thawh tûr bituk chu tlâk thuai thuai rawh u,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chhawrtute chuan Israel zînga hotu atâna an ruatte chu an vau va, “Nimin leh vawiina in leirawhchan siam tûr zât engati nge in siam loh?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Israel zînga hotua ruatte chu Farawa hnênah an kal a, “I chhiahhlawhte hi engtizia nge heti taka i tih tâk le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />I chhiahhlawhte hi buhpâwl min pe si lo va, leirawhchan siam rawh u, min ti a, min vua a; kan thiam loh a ni hlei nêm, i mite tihdik loh alâwm,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ani chuan, “In thatchhia a ni, in thatchhiat chhuanlamah ‘ Lalpa hnênah i inthawi ang u,’ in ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kal vat ula, in hna chu thawk mai rawh u, buhpâwl kan pe lo vang che u, leirawhchan in siam tûr tuk zât kha tihtlêm a ni hek lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ni tina leirawhchan siam tûr tuk zât chu tihtlêm a ni lo vang tih an han hriat chuan Israel zînga hotute chu an hrilhhai hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Farawa an biak zawh chuan anmahni nghâktu Mosia leh Arona chu an rawn pan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“ Lalpa chuan in thiltih hi a hmu a, a tuartîr ngei ang che u. Lal leh a upate chuan min huat tâk hi. Min that mah se chhuanlam remchâng in siamsak ta a nih hi,” an rawn ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mosia chuan Lalpa lam a hawi a; “ Lalpa , engtizia nge i mite hi i va han tinawmnah ve? Engah kher kher nge mi tirh le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />I hminga Farawa hnêna thu sawi tûra ka kal chinah ka mite hi a tinawmnah lehzual sauh a ni; nang lahin i mite hi i chhan duh hauh si lo va,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Mosia hnênah, “Farawa chunga ka thiltih tum i hmu dâwn ta e; anmahni chhuah tûrin chak takin ka nawr ang a, a ram ata a ûm chhuak ang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathianin Mosia hnênah, “ Lalpa ka nih hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Abrahama hnênah te, Isaka hnênah te, Jakoba hnênah te El-Sadaia-in ka inlâr a; mahse, ka hming Lalpa hi ka hrilh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An mikhualna ram, Kanan ram chu pe tûrin an hnênah thu ka tiam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aigupta mite bawiha tâng Israel fate mangang au thâwm chu ka hre bawk a ni; ka thuthlung pawh ka hre reng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chuvângin, Israel fate chu hrilh rawh. Lalpa chu ka nih hi; Aigupta mite nghâwngkawl lak ata ka la chhuak ang che u a, an bawih ata ka chhuah ang che u. Ka bân tha chakin ka chhan chhuak ang che u a, anni chu na takin ka hrem ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka mite in ni ang a, in Pathian ka ni bawk ang. Aigupta mite bawih ata ka lâk chhuah hun che u chuan kei hi in Pathian, Lalpa chu ka ni tih in hria ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Abrahama te, Isaka te, Jakoba te hnêna bân phar meuhva pêk ka tiam ramah ka hruai ang che u a, in rochan atân ka pe ang che u, Lalpa ka nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mosia chuan Israel fate chu chutiang chuan a hrilh a; mahse, an bawih nghâwngkawl chu an tân a rih êm avâng chuan an bei a dawng a, Mosia thu chu an ngaithla duh lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Mosia chu a bia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Kal la, Aigupta lal Farawa chu a ram aṭanga Israel fate chhuah tûrin va hrilh rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mosia chuan Lalpa hnênah “Israel fate pawhin ka thu an ngaithla duh lo va, Farawa phei chuan engtin nge ka thu a ngaihthlâk ang, ṭawnghmang lah ka thiam si lo,” tiin a ṭang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Mosia leh Arona hnênah, “Aigupta ram ata Israel-te hruai chhuak tûrin ka ti che u tih Israel fate leh Farawa chu hrilh rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hêng hi a chi chia an hotute chu an ni: Reubena thlahte: Hanoka, Palua, Hezrona, Karmia;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Simeona thlahte: Jemuela, Jamina, Ohada, Jakina, Zohara, Kanan hmeichhe laka a fa Saula; chûngho chu Simeon chite chu an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hêng hi Levia thlah chhâwng zêlte chu an ni: Gersona, Kohata, Meraria. Levia chu kum za leh sawmthum leh pasarih a dam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Gersona fate: Libnia, Simeia; anni hian fa an ngah hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kohata fate: Amrama, Izara, Hebrona, Uziela. Kohata chu kum za leh sawmthum leh pathum a dam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Meraria fate: Mahlia, Musia. Hêng hi Levia thlah chhâwng zêlte an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amrama chuan a pa farnu Jokebedi nupuiah a nei a; Arona leh Mosia a hrinsak a. Amrama chu kum za leh sawmthum leh pasarih a dam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Izara fate: Kora, Nefega, Zikria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Uziela fate: Misaela, Elzafana, Sithria,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nasona farnu, Aminadaba fanu Elisebi chu Aronan nupuiah a nei a. Nadaba te, Abihua te, Eleazara te, Ithamara te a hrinsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kora fate: Asira, Elkana, Abiasafa. Hêng hi Kora thlahte chu an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Arona fapa Eleazara chuan Putiela fanute zînga pakhat nupuiah a nei a, Finehasa a hrinsak a. Chûngte chu Levia chi, a thlah chhûngkaw hotute chu an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Lalpa khân Arona leh Mosia hnênah, “Israel thlahte hi Aigupta ram ata an vaiin hruai chhuak vek rawh u” a ti a nih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mosia leh Arona hi an ni Aigupta lal Farawa hnêna, “Israel-te hi chhuah vek rawh,” titute chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Aigupta ramah Lalpa chuan Mosia a bia a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />‘ Lalpa ka ni a, ka hrilh apiang che Aigupta lal Farawa hrilh ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Mosia chuan Lalpa hnênah, “Ṭawnghmang ka thiam loh tehlul nên engtin nge Farawa chuan ka thu a ngaihthlâk duh ang?” tiin a ṭang a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Mosia hnênah, “Farawa tân Pathian angah ka siam dâwn che. I u Arona hi i zâwlneiah a ṭang ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thu ka pêk apiang che i hrilh ang a, i u Arona hian Farawa a hrilh chhâwng ang; ram ata Israel-te a chhuah tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Farawa chu ka tiluhlul ang a, chhinchhiahna leh thil makte Aigupta ramah ka ti ṭeuh vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ani chuan in thu a ngaithla duh lo vang a, Aigupta chungah kut ka thlâk ang a, ka hrem vak ang a; ka mi Israel-te chu, Aigupta ram aṭangin ka hruai chhuak ang. Aigupta ram chunga ka kut ka leka,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />an zînga mi Israel fate chu ka lâk chhuah hunah chuan, Aigupta mite chuan Lalpa ka nih an hre mai ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mosia leh Arona chuan Lalpa thupêk ang chuan an ti a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Farawa hnêna thu an sawi khân Mosia chu kum sawmriata upa a ni a, Arona chu kum sawmriat leh pathum a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Mosia leh Arona hnênah:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Faraw-an, ‘thil mak eng emaw tal han ti teh u,’ a lo tih chuan Arona hnênah, I tiang kha la la, Farawa hmaah tlûk rawh, rûlah a chang mai ang’ i ti dâwn nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mosia leh Arona chu Farawa hnênah chuan an kal a, Lalpa thupêk ang chuan an ti a. Arona chuan Farawa leh a hote hmaah chuan a tiang chu a tlûk a, rûlah a chang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Farawa chuan an rama mi fing te, dawithiam te a ko va, anniho chuan mitdawivaihin an tih ang chu an ti ve ta mai a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />an tiang chu an tlûk a, rûlah a chang ve ta a; mahse, Arona tiang chuan anniho tiang chu a dawlh ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lalpan a sawi ang khân Farawa chu a tiluhlul a, an thu chu a ngaithla duh lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Mosia hnênah, “Farawa chu a luhlul hle mai a, mite chu a chhuah duh lo va ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Zîngah Farawa hnênah kal ang che; lui kamah a lêng ang a, lui kamah chuan a hmuh ngei tûrah lo ding la: i tiang rûla chang kha hawl ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“ Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian chuan i hnênah, ‘Ka mite hi thlalêra chibai min bûk tûrin chhuah rawh,’ ti tûrin min tîr a ni. Tûn thlengin a thu i awih lo va,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: A thiltih aṭangin Lalpa hi tu nge a nih i hre mai ang, en ta che, ka tiang hawl hian luia tui hi ka vua ang a, thisenah a chang mai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Sanghate chu an thi ang a, lui chu a rim a chhia ang a, Aigupta mite chuan tui chu an ten ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Mosia hnênah, “Arona chu heti hian hrilh rawh, ‘I tiang la la, Aigupta rama lui chungahte lek rawh, an luipui chungah te, luite chungah te, dîl chungahte lek rawh, thisenah a chang dâwn nia,’ ti ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mosia leh Arona chuan Lalpa thupêk ang chuan an ti a, a tiang chu a lek a, Farawa leh a hote hmuhah chuan luia tuite chu a vua a, luia tui zawng zawng chu thisenah a chang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Luia sanghate chu an thi a, lui tui chu a uih ta hluah hluah a. Aigupta mite chuan lui tui chu an in thei ta lo va; Aigupta ram pum tui chu thisenah a chang vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Aigupta dawithiamte chuan mitdawivaih hmangin an ti ve ta mai a; Farawa chu a luhlul sauh va, Lalpa sawi ang khân an thu chu a ngaithla duh ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Farawa chu a inah a haw a, eng mah a pawisa chuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Aigupta mite chuan lui tui chu an in theih loh avângin a kamah in tûr tui an hai chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Lalpan lui tui a vuak kha ni sarih a ni tawh a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Mosia a bia a, “Farawa hnênah kal la, a hnênah, ‘ Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti, ti rawh: ‘ka mite hi chhuah rawh; tichuan, ka rawng an bâwl dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />An kal i phal loh chuan i ram pum pui hi chungu-in ka rawn hrem ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Luiahte chungu a khat ang a, an lo chhuak ang a, i inahte pawh an lût ang a, i mut pindan leh i khumah te, i chhiahhlawhte leh i mite inah te, i thukah te leh i chhang hmehna thlêngah te hial pawh an lo awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chungu chuan an rawn bâwm ang che, i mite leh i chhiahhlawhte pawh an rawn bâwm ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Mosia hnênah, “Arona chu heti hian hrilh rawh: ‘I tiang kha lui chungah te, tui kawngah te, dîl chungahte lek rawh; tichuan, Aigupta ramah chungu a lo puang chiam dâwn nia, tiin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Arona chuan Aigupta ram tui chungahte chuan a tiang chu a lek a, chungu a lo chhuak ta chiam a, Aigupta ramah chuan an khat ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Dawithiamte pawh chuan mitdawivaih hmangin khawmualah chuan an tichhuak ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Farawa chuan Mosia leh Arona chu a ko va, “Chungu hi la bo tûrin Lalpa min ngensak rawh u; tichuan, Lalpa hnêna in inthawi theih nân in mite chu ka chhuah ang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mosia chuan, “Ngensak e a, nang leh i upate leh i mite in aṭanga chungu-in an ṭînsan che ua, luiah chauh an awm hun tûr ruat la, ka dîlsak ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Naktûk aṭangin le,” a ti a. “ Lalpa kan Pathian ang rêng hi an awm lo tih i hriat theih nân i tih ang chu ni ang hmiang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chungu chuan an chhuahsan ang che, i in aṭangin an chhuak ang a, luiah chauh an awm tawh ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mosia leh Arona chu Farawa hma ata chu an chhuak a, Mosia chuan Lalpa hnênah Farawa bâwmtu chungu chu lâk bosak tûrin a ngên a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mosia thu ang chuan a ti a, chungute chu inah te, tualah te, lovah te an thi ta phung a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />An vawm khâwm a, a ram pumin a uih ta vung vung a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Farawa chuan chungute chu an thi zo ta tih a hriat chuan luhlul a chhuah a, Lalpa sawi ang khân an thu chu a ngaithla duh chuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Mosia hnênah, “Arona chu hrilh rawh, a tiang chu la sela, vaivut vaw rawh se, Aigupta ram pumah hrikah a chang dâwn a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chutiang chuan an ti a; Arona chuan a tiang chu a lek a, lei vaivut chu a vua a, mihring leh rante chuan hrik chu an kai a; Aigupta rama vaivut zawng zawng chu hrikah a chang ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Dawithiamte chuan mitdawivaih hmangin tih ve an tum a; mahse, an ti thei lo. Ram pumah mihring leh sate chuan hrik an ngah ta êm êm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Dawithiamho chuan, “Hei chu Pathian tih a ni,” an ti a; mahse, Farawa chuan a luhlul a chhuah a. Lalpa sawi ang khân an thu chu a ngaithla duh lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Mosia hnênah, “Zîngah tho la, Farawa lui kamah a lêng leh ang a, a hmaah va ding la, a hnênah, Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti; ‘Ka rawng an bâwl theih nân ka mite hi chhuah rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka mite hi i chhuah duh loh chuan thophurh rual, nang leh i hote leh i mite seh tûr ka rawn tipung dâwn, i in chhûngah te leh Aigupta mite inah te a awm nuai nuai ang a, ramah pawh a awm sup sup ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ka mite awmna Gosen ram erawh chu ka zuah ang a, kei Lalpa hian hêng hi ka tih a ni tih i hriat theih nân thophurh chu a awm ve lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ka mite leh i mite chu ka thliar hrang dâwn a ni - he thil mak hi naktûkah tih a ni ang,’ a ti, ti ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Lalpa chuan a rawn ti ta ngei a, Farawa inah te, a hote inah te, Aigupta ramah te thophurh a lo awm ta nuai nuai a; thophurh a tam êm avang chuan ram pum chu a chhe nasa hle a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Farawa chuan Mosia leh Arona chu a ko va, “Kal ula, ram chhûngah in Pathian hnênah chuan inthawi rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mosia chuan, “A dik lo vang, Lalpa kan Pathian hnêna kan inthawina tûr hian Aigupta mite thin a tiur ngei ang; an ngaih theih loh zâwng kan tih chuan lungin min dêng mai ang le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />thlalêrah, ni thum kala hlaah, kan Pathianin thu min pêk angin kan va inthawi ang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“ Lalpa in Pathian hnêna inthawi tûr chuan ka kaltîr ang che u, hla takah erawh chuan in kal tûr a ni lo, min ṭawngṭaisak rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mosia chuan a chhâng a, “Ngai rawh, ka chhuak ang a, thophurh rual hi naktûkah i hnên ata te, i hote leh i mite hnên ata te bo vek tûrin ka dîlsak ang che. Lalpa hnêna inthawi tûra kan kal phal lovin Farawa chuan min tihder tawh teh suh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Mosia chu a chhuak a, Lalpa hnênah a ṭawngṭai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Farawa hnên aṭang te, a hote leh a mite hnên aṭang te chuan thophurh chu a tihkiansak ta a, pakhat mah a awm ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hemi ṭum pawh hian Farawa chuan luhlul a la chhuah ta tho va, mite chu a chhuah duh chuang lo va.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Mosia hnênah, “Farawa hnênah kal la, heti hian hrilh rawh: ‘Hebrai mite Pathian Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti; ka rawng an bâwl theih nân ka mite hi chhuah rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />I chhuah duh lohva, i chelh luih chuan
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa chuan rama ran tla, sakawr te, sabengtung te, sanghâwngsei te, bâwng te, berâm rualte chungah kut ka thlâk ang a, pûl hri na tak ka lêntîr ang,’ a ti:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Israel mite ran leh Aigupta mite ran a thliar hrang ang a, Israel fate ran pakhat mah a thi ve lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa chuan hun a ruat a, naktûkah Lalpa chuan he thil hi a ti ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalpa chuan a tûkah chu thil chu a ti ta ngei a, Aigupta mite ran zawng zawng chu a thi ta a; Israel fate ran erawh chu pakhat mah a thi ve lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Farawa chuan enthlithlai tûr mi a tîr a, Israel-te ran chu pakhat mah thi an hmu lo. Mahse, Farawa chuan luhlul a chhuah ta cheu va, mite chu a chhuah duh chuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Mosia leh Arona hnênah: “Meipui chunga inṭing ṭhûm khat va la ula, Farawa hmuhah Mosian vânvawrh rawh se,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />vaivut khu angin Aigupta ram pumah a darh ang a, Aigupta ram chhûnga mi leh sa zawng zawng tân khawihli huaisualah a chang ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Meipui inṭing chu an la a, Farawa hmaah chuan an ding a, Mosia chuan a vânvawrh ta a. Mi leh sa te tân khawihli huaisualah a chang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Khawihli avângin dawithiamho chuan Mosia chu an chelh ta lo va; khawihli chu Aigupta mi zawng zawng leh dawithiamte chuan an vei vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Farawa chu a tiluhlul a, Mosia hnêna Lalpa sawi ang ngei khân an thu chu a ngaithla duh chuang lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Mosia hnênah, “Zîng takah tho la, Farawa hmaah va ding la, hetiang hian va sawi rawh: ‘Hebrai mite Pathian Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: ka rawng an bâwl theih nân ka mite hi chhuah rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tûn ṭum chu i hote leh i mite mai ni lovin nang ngei pawh ka khawih dâwn che a ni; khawvêlah hian keimah ang rêng tu mah an awm lo tih i hriat theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nang leh i mite chu hri chhia vei tûrin ka kut lek khum che ila chuan in boral vek tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka thiltihtheihzia entîr tûr chein i nun ka la zuah a ni; tichuan, khawvêl pumah ka hming a thang dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />I lo chapo ta hle a, ka mite pawh i la chhuah duh lo cheu va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ngai rawh, naktûk hetih hunah hian rial ka tlâktîr chiam dâwn; chutianga nasa chu Aigupta ramah engtik lai mahin a la awm ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />I ran te leh i thil neih, ram palailênga awm apiang chu, khungtîr vek rawh, in khung ṭhat loh chuan mihring pawh ran pawh rialin a dêng ang a, an thi ang,’ a ti,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Farawa upa ṭhenkhat chuan Lalpa thu chu an pawisa a, an chhiahhlawhte leh an rante chu inah an awmtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ṭhenkhat erawh chuan Lalpa thu chu an pawisa lo va, an chhiahhlawhte leh rante chu ram palailêngah an awmtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Mosia hnênah, “Vân lamah i kut phar rawh; tichuan, Aigupta ram pumah rial a lo tla ang a; mihring te, ran leh thlai tinrêng a dêng ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mosia chuan a tiang chu vân lamah a lek a, Lalpa chuan khawpui a tiri a, rial a tlâktîr a, leiah ṭêkte a tla bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Rial chu a tla ta chur chur a, kâwl te a phe zawr zawr a, tûn hma hriat phâk chinah chutianga nasa chu Aigupta ramah a la awm ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ram palailênga awm zawng zawng, mihring pawh ran pawh rial chuan a dêng a, hnimte pawh a dêng a, thingte pawh a dêng bung rum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Israel fate awmna ram, Gosen ramah chuan rial chu a tla ve hauh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Farawa chuan Mosia leh Arona chu a kohtîr a, an hnênah, “Tûn ṭum zawng ka tisual a ni e, Lalpa chuan a tidik a, kei leh ka mite hian kan tidik lo a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Hêng khawpui ri dur dur leh rial tla chur chur hi titâwp tûrin Lalpa chu ngên teh u, mite chu ka chhuah ang a, kan chelh tawh lo vang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mosia chuan a hnênah, “Khua ata ka chhuah veleh Lalpa hnênah ka bân ka phar ang a, khawpui a ri tawh lo vang. Lalpa a ni tih i hriat nân rial pawh a tla tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Nang leh i hote zawngin Lalpa chu in ṭih dâwn chuang lo tih ka hria a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />La leh barli chu a chhe vek a, barli chu a vui a, la pawh a pâr lai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Huit leh buhtun erawh chu a la vui lo va, a chhe ve lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Farawa in aṭangin Mosia chuan khawpui a chhuahsan a, Lalpa lamah a bân a phar a, khawpui leh rial chu a bâng ta a; leia ruah lo sûr pawh a hân ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ruah te, rial te, khawpui te a reh tâk hnu chuan Farawa chuan a suahsual a thawh a, a hote nên luhlul an chhuah leh ta zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Mosia hnêna Lalpa sawi tawh ang khân Farawa chuan luhlul a chhuah a, Israel fate chu a chhuah duh chuang lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Mosia hnênah, “Farawa hnênah kal rawh, ka thiltih makte an zînga ka tih theih nân a hote nên ka tiluhlul a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tin, nangnin in fate hnênah te, in tute hnênah te, in tuchhuante hnênah te Aigupta rama ka thiltih hi in inhrilh chhâwng zêl ang a, Lalpa hian chûng chu ka tih a ni tih in hriat theih nân,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mosia leh Arona chu Farawa hnênah an kal a, “Hebrai mite Pathian Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: ‘Eng chen nge ka hmaah i inphahhniam duh loh dâwn? Ka rawng an bâwl theih nân ka mite hi chhuah rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka mite hi i chhuah duh loh chuan naktûkah in ram chhûngah hian khau ka tipuang ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ram chu an bawh khat tlat ang a, lei pawh a hmuh theih lo vang. Rial chhut chhiat loh, thil eng pawh la awm chu, an ei zo vek ang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />i inah te, i hote inah te leh Aigupta mi zawng zawng inah te an khat ang; in pate leh in pute pawhin, he rama in awm chinah chutiang khawpa tam khau puang chu an la hmu ngai lo vang,’ a ti e, ti rawh min ti,” an ti a. Farawa in ata chu an chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Farawa hote chuan a hnênah, “He pa hian eng chen nge min tihbuai dâwn le? Chhuah mai rawh, an Pathian Lalpa rawng chu va bâwl rawh se. Aigupta ram a chhiat zawh tawh hi i hre lâwm ni?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mosia leh Arona chu Farawa hnênah an rawn hruai leh a, an hnênah, “Kal ta ula, in Pathian Lalpa rawng chu va bâwl rawh u. Tute nge kal ang?” a lo ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mosia chuan, “A pui a nawiin kan kal ang, kan fanu kan fapate nên, kan berâm leh ran rualte pawh kan hruai ang; Lalpa hmaah ruai ṭheh tûr a ni si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ani chuan, “In nupui fanaute nêna ka chhuah vek loh tûrzia che u chu Lalpa chhâlin ka sawi hi. Hel in tum rilru tih a lang chiang alâwm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />In duh angin paho chu kal ula, Lalpa rawng chu va bâwl rawh u,” a ti a. Farawa in aṭang chuan Mosia leh Arona chu an hnawt chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Mosia hnênah, “Aigupta ram chungah i bân phar rawh; Aigupta ramah khau a lo puang ang a, rialin a chhut chhiat bâng kha an ei zo vek dâwn nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mosia chuan Aigupta ram chungah chuan a tiang chu a lek a. Lalpa chuan nilêng leh zankhuain khawchhak thli a tlehtîr a, zîngah chuan thli chuan khau chu a rawn lên ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aigupta ramah khau chu a awm ta nuai nuai a, an fu tep tup a, an tam ngei mai! Chutiang khawpa tam chu tûn hma khân a la awm ngai lo, awm pawh a awm leh ngai hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ram pum an dâp a, khua an hliah thim khup a, rial den chhiat bâng thlai chi tinrêng leh thei chi tinrêng an khel fai vek a. Aigupta ram pum puiah hnim hring emaw, thing hring emaw hmuh tûr rêng a awm ta hauh lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hmanhmawh takin Farawa chuan Mosia leh Arona chu a ko va, “In Pathian Lalpa chungah leh in chungah ka lo tidik lo a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka thil tihsual hi tûn ṭum chu min ngaidam teh u. In Pathian Lalpa chu thih theihna khawpa min hrem hi titâwp tûrin min ngensak rawh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Farawa in aṭang chuan an chhuak a. Lalpa hnênah an dîlsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lalpa chuan khawthlang thli na tak a tlehtîr a, khau chu a lên a, Tuipui Senah a lên lût ta vek a. Aigupta ram chhûngah chuan khau pakhat mah a awm ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Farawa chu a tiluhlul ta cheu va, Israel fate chu a chhuah duh chuang lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Mosia hnênah, “I bân vân lamah phar rawh; tichuan, Aigupta ram pum hi thim chhah mupin a khuh ang a, ai-mit-thlawn ang maiin a awm dâwn nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mosia chuan a kut chu a phar a, ni thum chhûng chu Aigupta ram a thim ta tlat a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />tu mah an inhmu thei lo va, mahni awmhmun ata ni thum chhûng chu che sawn thei pawh an awm lo. Israel mite awmnaah erawh chuan êng a awm thung a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Farawa chuan Mosia chu a ko va, “Kal ula, Lalpa rawng chu va bâwl rawh u, in fanaute nên kal ula, in berâm leh bâwng rualte erawh chu hruai suh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mosia chuan, “Chuti a nih chuan thilhlan tûr leh hâlrala hman tûr ran min tumsak i peih ang emaw chu!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Kan rante chu pakhat mah hnutchhiah lo zâwk ila a ṭha ang. Keimahni ngeiin kan Pathian Lalpa biakna tûr ran chu kan thlang zâwk tûr a ni. A hmun kan va thlen tê tê loh chuan ran eng ang nge hlan tûr kan hre rih si lo va,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Farawa chu a tiluhlul leh a, a chhuah duh chuang ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Farawa chuan a hnênah, “Ka hmuh tûrah awm tawh suh, fîmkhur rawh, mi rawn hmuh tum tawh suh, ka hmuh leh vaih che chuan ka tihlum ngei ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mosia chuan, “I sawi dik ang, ka rawn hmu leh tawh lo vang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Mosia hnênah, “Farawa leh Aigupta ram chu ṭum khat dang ka khawih leh ang a, a chhuah tawh ang che u. A chhuah vêk vêk che u chuan a hnawhin a ni a hnawh chhuah dâwn che u ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chuvângin, mipui hnênah rangkachak leh tangkaraw thawmhnaw an ṭhenawmte ta, a hawh man pe lovin dîl rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel mite chu Lalpa chuan Aigupta-ho chu a duhsaktîr a. Mosia chu Aigupta ram mi lâr tak a ni a, Farawa hote leh a mite chuan an ngaisâng êm êm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Mosia chuan Farawa hnênah “ Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti; ‘Aigupta ram chu zanlaiah ka fang dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aigupta mite fa tîr, Farawa fa tîr, lalṭhutthlênga ṭhu aṭanga bawihnu, buh râwtsawmtu fa tîr thlengin, an ran fa tîrte nên lam an thi vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chumi zân chuan Aigupta ram pumah an ṭap chuah chuah ang a, chutianga nasa chu a awm ngai lo va, a awm leh tawh ngai hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel fate erawh chu tu mah, an rante lamin ui pawhin a bauh lo vang. Lalpa chuan Aigupta mite leh Israel fate chu a ngai danglam ngei a lo ni tih in hria ang,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />I hote ka hnênah an lo kal ang a, ka hmaah an rawn kûn ang; ka mite chu hruaia kal bo daih tûrin min rawn ngên ang. Chumi hun chuan ka mite chu ka chhuahpui ang,” a ti a. Thinur takin Farawa chu a chhuahsan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Mosia hnênah, “Farawa chuan in thu a ngaithla chuang dâwn lo, Aigupta ramah thil mak tih belh a ngai dâwn a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mosia leh Arona chuan chûng thil mak chu Farawa hmuh tûrin an ti a. Lalpa chuan Farawa chu a tiluhlul a, a ram ata Israel fate chu a chhuah duh lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aigupta ramah Lalpa chuan Mosia leh Arona hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Tûn thla hi thla chhiar ṭanna ni sela, kum khat chhûnga thla hmasa ber atân hmang ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel pungkhâwmho hrilh rawh: Tûn thla ni sâwm ni hian chhûng tin mahni chhûng ei tâwk berâmno emaw, kêltê emaw thlang ṭheuh rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Berâmno pakhat ei sêng lo khawpa chhûng tlêm an nih chuan an ṭhenawmte nên inthurual sela, an tam dân azir leh an ei theih tûr zât azirin insem rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Berâm chu a hmêlhem tûr a ni lo, berâm rual emaw, kêl rual zînga mi emaw kum khat aia upa lo, a pa, hmêlhem lo, in duh zâwk zâwk in thlang thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ni sâwm leh pali ni thlengin in thlang ang a, chumi ni tlai lamah chuan Israel hnam pum pui chuan an talh tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A thisen chu an la ang a, an eina tûr in kawngka biang tawnah leh kawngka lu chungah an tât tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chumi zân chuan sa chu an hem hmin ang a, an ei tûr a ni; dawidim telh loh chhang leh lambak nên an ei tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A hela ei tûr a ni lo, chhum tûr a ni hek lo; a lu leh a ke te, a kawchhûngte nên lam meia hem hmin tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />In ei bâng chu zîng thlengin a awm tûr a ni lo; chutiang ei bâng in neih chuan in rawh ral tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pheikhawk bun diamin tiang in keng ang a, inchei fel sa vekin in ei sawk sawk tûr a ni. Lalpa chawimawi nâna kalhlên kût a ni e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chumi zân chuan Aigupta ram ka fang chhuak ang a, Aigupta mi, fa tîr, mihring pawh ran pawh, a pa chu ka that vek dâwn; Aigupta pathiante pawh ka sawisa ang. Lalpa ka nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kawngka bianga thisen tah chu in awmna chhinchhiahna a ni ang a, thisen tah chu ka hmu ang a, chu in chu ka kal kân ang a; nangni chuan Aigupta mite angin in tuar ve lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chumi ni chu in tân ni serh a ni ang a, Lalpa thiltih in hriat reng nân in kût ṭhîn tûr a ni, ṭhangthar zêlte pawhin chu ni chu an serh kumkhua tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ni sarih chhûng chu dawidim telh loh chhang chauh in ei tûr a ni; a ni hmasa berah chuan in in chhûng ata dawidim rêng rêng in paih fai vek tûr a ni a, ni khat ni aṭanga a ni sarih ni inkâr chhûnga dawidim telh chhang ei chu Israel mite zînga chhiar tel loh tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A ni khat ni leh a ni sarih ni chuan inkhâwmpui urhsûn in nei tûr a ni; chumi chhûng chuan eng hna mah in thawk tûr a ni lo; in ei tûr erawh chu in siam thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chhang dawidim telh loh kût hi in hmang ṭhîn tûr a ni, hemi ni hian Israel mipui chu Aigupta ram aṭangin ka hruai chhuak a ni; ṭhangthar zêlte pawhin dâna neihin he ni hi an hmang zêl tûr a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />thla hmasa ber ni sâwm leh pali tlai aṭangin ni sawmhnih leh pakhat tlai thlengin dawidim telh chhang in ei tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ni sarih chhûng chu in in chhûngah dawidim pakhat mah a awm tûr a ni lo va. Dawidim telh chhang ei chu, in zînga châm mai a ni emaw, in zînga piang a ni emaw, Israel mipui zînga chhiar tel tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Dawidim tel rêng rêng in ei tûr a ni lo, in awmna apiangah chhang dawidim telh loh in ei tûr a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mosia chuan Israel upaho chu a ko khâwm vek a, “Berâmno emaw, kêltê emaw thlang thuai ula, in chhûnga ei tûrin kalhlên kût sa atân talh rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Husop têl khâwm ula, maihûna thisenah chuan in hnim ang a, kawngka biang tawnah leh kawngka lu chungah thisen chu in tât dâwn nia; a tûk khua a vâr hma chu tu mah mahni in ata in chhuak tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aigupta mite that tûrin Lalpa chuan a rawn fang dâwn a ni. Kawngka lu chung leh a biang tawna thisen a hmuh chuan kawngka chu a kal kân ang a, tihlumtu chu nangni that tûrin a lo luh a phal lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />He thil hi dâna neihin in serh ang a, in fate pawhin an serh kumkhua tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Lalpa thutiam anga ram a pêk tûr che u in thlen hunah pawh hetiang serh leh sâng hi in chhunzawm zêl tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“In faten, ‘Hetiang serh leh sâng hi eng tihna nge?’ tia an zawh che u chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />‘ Lalpa chawimawina Kalhlên Kût a nih hi. Ani chuan Aigupta mite a thah lai khân Aigupta rama awm Israel-te in a kal hlên a, min zuah a ni; chumi chawimawina chu a ni,’ in ti dâwn nia,” a ti a. Mipui chu an kûn a, Pathian chibai an bûk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Israel fate chu an tho va, Mosia leh Arona hnêna Lalpa thupêk ang chuan an ti ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Zânlaiah Lalpa chuan Aigupta rama an fa tîr zawng zawng chu a tihlum ta a. Farawa fa tîr, lalṭhutthlênga ṭhu tûr aṭanga ripa tâng fa tîr thlengin, ran, a pa piang hmasa ber te nên lam a that ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Zânlaiah Farawa chu a tho va, a hote zawng zawng leh Aigupta mi zawng zawng chu an tho va, mitthi awm lohna chhûng rêng a awm lo va, Aigupta mite chu ram pum puiah an ṭap ta chuah chuah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A zân a zânin Mosia leh Arona chu Farawa chuan a ko va, “Ka mite hi chhuahsan ula, in sawi angin Israel fate nên Lalpa rawng chu va bâwl rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />In berâm te, in bâwng te pawh in duh angin hruai rawh u; chhuak thuai rawh u. Malsâwmna min dîlsak bawk ang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Aigupta mite chuan chhuak thuai thuai tûrin an tur ta sek a. “Kan thi zo mai dâwn alâwm,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Mite chuan an chhang ur tûr hmeh sa dawidim la telh loh chu an fûn a, chhang hmeh thlêng chu puanin an tuam a, an kokiah an bât a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Mosia thu angin Israel fate chuan an ti a, Aigupta mite chu tangkarua leh rangkachak ṭhi leh thawmhnaw dangte an dîl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Lalpa chuan mite chu Aigupta mite a khawngaihtîr a, an dîl apiang an pe a. Tichuan, Aigupta mite thil neih chu an rawk a ni ta ngawt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Israel fate chu Ramases aṭangin Sukot an thleng a, kea kal chu an vaiin mi nuairuk an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Hnam dang tam tak an kal tel ve a, berâm te, kêl te, bâwngte nên an kawi duah mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Aigupta ram aṭanga chhang hmeh sa dawidim telh loh an ken chu an kang a; Aigupta ram ata an hnawh chhuah tâk avângin an ei tûr pawh an siam ṭha hman lo a ni, an chhang hmeh sa pawh dawidim an phul hman lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Israel fate Aigupta rama an awm chhûng chu kum zali leh sawmthum a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Kum zali leh sawmthum a ral ni ngei chuan Lalpa mite chuan Aigupta chu an chhuahsan leh ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Chumi zân chu Aigupta ram aṭanga hruai chhuah zân a ni a, Lalpa zân serh a ni. Hemi zân hi Israel fate pawhin ṭhangthar zêl thlenga zân serha an hman kumkhua tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Mosia leh Arona hnênah, “Hei hi Kalhlên Kût hman dân tûr thupêk chu a ni: Hnam dang miten kût sa hi an ei ve tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, in chhiahhlawh, pawisaa in lei, an serh in tansakte chuan an ei ve thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Ram dang mi, in zînga awm vete leh in hnêna inhlawhfate pawhin an ei tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />In khatah in ei tûr a ni, hmun dangah in la ṭhen tûr a ni lo va, a ruh in titliak tûr a ni hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Israel pungkhâwmho chuan chutiang chuan an ti tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Mikhual, in ina chêngte chuan Lalpa tâna kût sa chu an ei ve duh chuan mipa zawng zawng serh chu tansak phawt tûr a ni; chumi hnuah chuan in zînga piang ve ang chiahin en tawh tûr an ni a; kût sa te pawh an ei ve thei tawh ang; serh tan loh erawh chuan an ei tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />In zînga piang in mite leh hnam dang, in zînga lo pêm lûtte chu angkhatin dân thuhmun in hmantîr tûr a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Mosia leh Arona hnêna Pathian thupêk ang tak chuan Israel fate chuan an ti ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Chumi ni ngei chuan Israel fate chu Aigupta ram aṭangin Lalpa chuan a hruai chhuak ta vek a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Mosia a bia a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Israel-te zînga fa tîr, mipa, chhûl keu tawh phawt chu, an ran no, a pa, piang hmasa ber nên ka tân serh hrang rawh, ka ta an ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mosia chuan mipuite hnênah, “Vawiin hi hre reng rawh u, Aigupta ramah bawih in ni a, in chhuak ta a nih hi. He hmun aṭangin Lalpa chuan a chakna hmangin a hruai chhuak che u a ni. Chhang dawidim telh in ei hauh tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Abib thla, vawiin hian in chhuak a nih hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kanan mite ram, Hit mi te, Amor mi te, Hiv mi te, Jebus mite awmna, khawizu leh hnutetuia luang ram, in pate hnênah pêk che u a lo tiam tawh ram a hruai thlen hunah che u chuan, hemi thlaah hian kût hi in hmang ṭhîn tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ni sarih chhûng dawidim telh loh chhang in ei tûr a ni a; a ni sarih ni chuan Lalpa chawimawi nân ruai ṭheh tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ni sarih chhûng chu dawidim telh chhang in ei tûr a ni lo, in ramah dawidim pawh, dawidim telh chhang pawh a awm tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />In fate hnênah, ‘Aigupta ram aṭanga kan chhuah dâwn laia Lalpa thiltih avânga hêng hi ti kan ni,’ tiin hrilh ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“In kuta chhinchhiahna leh in mit kâra hriatrengna thil hrên in hrêng ang hian Lalpa dân chu lam nachâng in hriat theih nân in hmang ṭhîn dâwn nia. Aigupta ram aṭangin a thiltihtheihna ropui tak hmangin a hruai chhuak si che u a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kum tin kût chu a hun takah in hmang ziah tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Kanan mite ram, in pate hnêna pêk che u a tiam chu Lalpa chuan a hruai thlen che ua, a pêk hunah che u chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />in fa tîr apiang, mipa tawh phawt chu, Lalpa hnênah in hlân tûr a ni. In rante pawh an no hmasa, a pa tawh phawt chu, Lalpa hnênah in hlân tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sabengtungno hmasa ber erawh chu a aiah berâmno hlânin in tlan tûr a ni. In tlan duh loh chuan a ring elhtliak ang che u. In fa tîr te chu in tlan ngei tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Nakin hnuah in faten, ‘Hei hi eng tihna nge?’ tia an zawh che u chuan, ‘Aigupta rama bawiha kan awm, Lalpa chuan a chakna hmangin min hruai chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Faraw-an kan chhuah a phal loh lai khân, Aigupta rama fa tîr, mihring pawh ran pawh, a tihlum vek a; chuvângin, chhûl keu tawh phawt chu Lalpa hnênah kan hlân zêl a ni; keimahni fate erawh chu kan tlan ṭhîn a ni,’ in la ti dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chutia in tih chuan kut emaw, chal emaw hrên angin Aigupta ram aṭangin Lalpa chuan a chakna hmangin a hruai chhuak che u a ni tih in hre reng thei ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Faraw-an mite a chhuah khân kawng hnai zâwk, Filistia mite rama kal tlang kawngah chuan a hruai lo va, miten indona an hmuhin an inchhîr palh ang a, Aigupta ramah an kîr leh mai ang tih a hlau a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thlalêr lam, Tuipui Sen lamah a kual zâwngin a hruai ta zâwk a. Israel fate chu Aigupta ram aṭang chuan hriamhrei nên, a pâwl pâwlin an chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Pathianin a hre reng ang che u a, ka ruhte hi in zâwn chho dâwn nia,” tia a chah anga tih an tiam tlat angin Mosia chuan Josefa ruhte chu a keng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sukot aṭang chuan an kal zêl a, thlalêr tâwp Etham-ah bûk an khuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chhûn leh zâna an kal theih nân Lalpa chuan chhûnah chhûm dingin an hma a hruai a, zânah mei dingin an kawng a tieng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chhûna chhûm ding leh zâna mei ding chuan mite chu a kalsan ngai lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Mosia hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Israel fate chu hrilh rawh; kîr leh sela, Migdol leh Tuipui Sen inkârah Pi-hahirot ep Baal-zefon bulah riahhmun khuar rawh se,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Farawa chuan, ‘Heti hian Israel fate chu kalna mumal hre lovin thlalêrah an tâng ta,’ a ti rilru dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Farawa chu ka tiluhlul ang a, a ûm ang che u a, Farawa leh a hote chungah ka ropuizia ka tilang ang a, Lalpa chu ka ni tih an hria ang,” a ti a. Chutiang chuan an ti ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Israel-te an tlân chhuah tâk thu chu Aigupta lal an hrilh a. Farawa leh a ṭhuihruaite chu Israel-te chungah an thu a khauh ta hle a; “Israel-te tha chhawr lova kan chhuah ta mai hi engtizia nge?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Farawa chuan a sakawrtawlailîr a buatsaihtîr a, a sipaite chu a hruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sakawrtawlailîr ṭha ṭha zaruk leh Aigupta ram tawlailîr khalh thiam thlante nên an ûm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Aigupta lal Farawa chu a tiluhlul a, Israel faten inchhuang taka Aigupta an chhuahsan hum hum chu an ûm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Farawa sakawr leh a tawlailîr te, a sipai te leh sakawr chungchuang, Aigupta mite chuan Pi-hahiroth ep, Baal-zefon bulah Tuipui kama an awm chu an va ûmphâk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Israel fate chuan Farawa hoten an rawn ûm pha dâwn ta mai tih an hmuhin an hlau hle a. Lalpa chu ṭanpuiah an sâwm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mosia hnênah, “Thlân a awm loh avângin em ni thi tûra thlalêra min hruai chhuah hi? Eng atân nge Aigupta ram aṭang khân min lo hruai chhuah le?”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kan chhuah hma khân hetiangin thil a awm ang tih kan hrilh lo che em ni? Min nawr lui lo mai rawh, Aigupta mite rawng hi kan bâwl zêl mai ang e; thlalêra thihsâwn ai chuan Aigupta mite bawih nih a ṭha zâwk kan tih kha,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mosian mipui hnênah, “Hlau suh ula, zâm suh u, vawiina Pathianin a rawn chhanhim dân tûr che u hi thlîr mai rawh u. Vawiina Aigupta mi in hmuhte hi in hmu leh tawh ngai lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Eng mah in tih ve a ngai lo vang, Lalpan a dosak dâwn che u alâwm,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Mosia hnênah, “Engah nge min auh chûl le? Israel fate chu hma lama kal zêl tûrin hrilh rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />I tiang kha lek la, tuipui chungah i bân phar la, tui chu tiṭhen rawh, Israel fate chu Tuipui mawng leichârah an kal dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Keiin Aigupta mite chu ka tiluhlul ang a, in hnungah an rawn ûmzui ang che u. Tichuan, Farawa leh a sipaite, a tawlailîr leh sakawr chungchuang mite avângin ropuina ka chang dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Farawa te, a tawlailîr te leh a sakawr chungchuang mite chunga ka intihropui hunah chuan kei hi Lalpa chu ka ni tih in hria ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Israel-te hmaa awm ṭhîn Lalpa vântirhkoh chu a insawn a, an hnung lamah a awm ta a, an hmaa chhûm ding pawh kha an hnung lamah a insawn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Israel-te leh Aigupta mite awmna inkârah chuan a awm ta a. Israel mite awmna chu a chhun êng a, Aigupta mite awmna erawh chu a tithim a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mosia chuan tuipui chungah a bân a phar a, Lalpa chuan zankhuain khawchhak thli na tak a tlehtîr a, tuipui chu a chhêm kiang a, tui chu a inṭhen a, tuipui mawng chu leichârah a chang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Israel fate chu tuipui mawng leichârah chuan an kal ta a, an ding lam leh vei lamah tui chu bang angin a ding tawn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aigupta mite chuan an ûm zêl a, Farawa sakawr te, a tawlailîr te, a sakawr chungchuang mite chuan tuipui mawngah chuan an ûmzui zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A tûk khawfîng chah hmain Lalpa chuan Aigupta sipaite chu chhûm ding leh mei ding kârah chuan a zu hmu a, a zuk timangang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />An tawlailîr ke te chu a titâng a, a lîr ṭha hlei thei ta lo va. Aigupta mite chuan, “ Lalpan Israel-te lama ṭangin min do a nih hi; hawh u, i hawsan thuai ang u,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Mosia hnênah, “Tuipui chungah i bân phar rawh, tuite chuan Aigupta mi, an tawlailîrte leh an sakawr chungchuangte chu a chîm dâwn nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mosia chuan tuipui chungah a bân a phar a, ni a lo chhuah chuan tui chu a insuih zawm leh ta pûng a, Aigupta mite chuan tlânchhiat an tum a; mahse, Lalpa chuan anni chu tuiah chuan a paih lût a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tui lo infin leh chuan tawlailîr te, sakawr chungchuang mi te, Farawa sipai zawng zawng, tuipui mawnga ûmzuitute chu a chîm ta vek a, pakhat mah chhuak an awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Israel fate erawh chu tuipui mawng leichârah chuan an kal a, bang angin an sîr tuakah chuan tui chu a ding luah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Chumi ni chuan Lalpa chuan Israel-te chu Aigupta mite kut ata chu a chhanhim a, Aigupta mi, tuipuia thi ruangte chu an hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Aigupta mite chunga Lalpa thiltih râpthlâk tak chu Israel-te chuan an hmu a; Lalpa chu an hlau va. Lalpa leh a chhiahhlawh Mosia chu rinpuiah an neih ta a. Mosia leh Israel fate chuan Lalpa chawimawi nân he hla hi an sa ta dual dual a:
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“ Lalpa fakin hla ka sa ang, Ropui takin a hneh ta si a. Sakawr leh a chungchuang tuipuiah a paih thla.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa chu mi tichaktu, Zaia ka fak chu a ni; Min chhandamtu a ni, Ani chu ka Pathian a ni a, ka chawimawi ang. Kan pate Pathian a ni a, a ropuizia ka hril ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa chu râl do mi a ni a, A hming chu Lalpa a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Farawa leh a tawlailîr chu a sipai rualte nên tuipuiah a paih thla a, Sipai hotu ṭhate pawh Tuipui Senah an pil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tui thûkah chuan an tla a, Lungtum angin tuipui mawngah an pil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , i kut ding lam chu a va chak êm! Aw Lalpa , i hmêlmate chu i râwt sawm tâk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nangmah dotute chu ropui takin i hneh a, I thinur alh chuan buhpâwl angin a kâng ral ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />I thâwk khum a, tui chu a lo intiang a, Bang ang maiin a lo ding ta luah a, A thûk laite chu a lo châr zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />‘Kan ûm ang a, kan nangchîng ang a, Duhtâwkin an chungah kan che ang a, An neih zawng zawng kan insem ang,’ hmêlmate chuan an ti vei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />I thli i han chhêmtîr a, Tuipui chuan a chîm pil ta a, Tui thûkah chuan suan tlang angin an pil zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />‘Aw Lalpa , nang ang rênga thianghlim leh ropui, Fak tlâk leh thiltithei Pathian dang an awm em ni le?’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />I kut ding lam i han phar a, Hmêlmate chu leiin a dawlh zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />I mi, i tlante chu lainatin i hruai a, I ram thianghlimah i chaknain i hruai thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Miten an lo hriatin an khûr a, Filistia rama awmte an thauvah a man.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Edom ram hotute an thlabâr a, Moab hruaitute an thlaphâng a, Kanan rama mite an zâm zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />I mi, i mi thlanten an kal pelh hma loh chuan I chakzia an hmuhin hlauvin an khûr a, Lungtum ang maiin an chechâng lo. Hlau leh khûrin an khawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />I tlâng thianghlimah chuan i hruai thleng a, I phun ta a; Aw Lalpa , nangma chênna tûr hmun i siam ngeiah chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lalpa chu chatuan chatuanin a lal ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Farawa sakawrte chu, a tawlailîrte leh sakawr chungchuangte nên tuipuiah an tlân lût a; Lalpa chuan tuipui tui chu a tikîr a, a chîmtîr a, Israel fate erawh chu tuipui mawng leichârah an kal kai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Arona u, zâwlnei Miriami chuan perhkhuang a keng a, hmeichhe dangte pawh chuan perhkhuang kengin an zui a, an lâm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Miriami-te chuan hetiangin hla an sa a: “ Lalpa chu fakin awm rawh se, a ropui êm e, Sakawr leh a chungchuangte chu tuipuiah a paih thla,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mosia chuan Israel fate chu Tuipui Sen aṭang chuan a hruai zêl a, Sur thlalêr an thleng a, ni thum an kal a, tui a awm lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tui awmna, Mara, an va thlen chuan a tui chu a khâk avângin an in thei si lo va, a hmingah pawh Mara an vuah rêng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mosia hnênah, “Eng nge kan in tâk ang?” tiin an phunnawi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mosia chuan Lalpa chu a au va, ani chuan thing pakhat a kawhhmuh a, chu chu tuiah chuan a chiah a, tui chu a lo tui ta a. Chutah chuan thupêk leh awm dân tûr a kawhhmuh a, anni chu hetiang hian a fiah ta a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“In Pathian Lalpa thu hi in ngaihthlâka, a mit hmuha thil dik in tih chuan, a thupêkte in zawma, a dânte in pawisak bawk chuan Aigupta mite tuar ang hri kha ka tuartîr ve lo vang che u; tidamtu che u Lalpa ka nih hi,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuikhur sâwm leh pahnih leh tûm kûng sawmsarih awmna hmun Elim chu an thleng a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Elim aṭang chuan an kal zêl a, Aigupta ram an chhuahsan aṭanga thla hnih leh ni sâwm an kal ni chuan Israel fate chu Elim leh Sinai inkâr Sin thlalêr an thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel pungkhâwmho chu Mosia leh Arona chungah an phunnawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />An hnênah Israel fate chuan, “Aigupta rama sa bêl bula kan ṭhut lai te, puar taka chaw kan ei lai te khân Lalpa chuan min lo tihlum mai se a ṭha zâwk tûr, thlalêra rilṭâma thi tûrin mi hei zozai hi min hruai chhuak a nih hi,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Mosia hnênah, “Ngai rawh, in ei tûr vân aṭangin ka rawn sûrtîr dâwn; mite chuan an ni khat tla chiah chhar rawh se; ka thu an zâwm dâwn nge dâwn lo ka fiah dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A ni ruk nia an chhar chu ei atân an buatsaih ang a, ni danga an chhar lêt an chhar tûr a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mosia leh Arona chuan Israel zawng zawng hmaah chuan, “ Lalpa chuan Aigupta ram aṭangin a hruai chhuak ngei che u a ni tih nakin tlaiah chuan in hria ang a, Lalpa ropuizia in hmu ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpa chunga in phunnawi kha a lo hria a ni, keini hi eng nge kan niha kan chunga in phunnawi ang le?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mosia chuan, “ Lalpan tlaiah sa a rawn pe dâwn che u a, zîngah puar tâwka in ei tûr chaw a pe bawk ang che u, a chunga in phunnawi thu hi a lo hria a, kan chunga in phun hi Lalpa chunga phunnawi in ni zâwk asin,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mosia chuan Arona hnênah, “Israel fa pungkhâwmho chu, ‘In phunnawina thu Lalpa chuan a lo hria a, a bulah lo kal hnai teh u,’ tiin hrilh rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aronan Israel pungkhâwmho hnêna thu a sawi lai chuan, thlalêr lam an han thlîr a, chhûmah Lalpa ropuina a lo lang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Mosia hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Israel-te phunnawina chu ka lo hria e, an hnênah, ‘zanriahah sa in ei ang, zîngah chaw puar takin in ei bawk ang, Kei Lalpa hi in Pathian chu ka ni tih in hria ang chu, a ti,’ ti rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tlaiah chuan vahmîm an lo thlâwk a, an bûk vêlah chuan an fu khat tlat a; zîngah chuan an bûk vêl chu daiin a khuh vek bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Dai chu a han hul chuan thlalêr leiah chuan thil vâr pan tê tê, vûr ang maia thianghlim hi a lo awm ṭeuh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Israel fate chuan, “Eng nge ni ngai?” an ti a; eng nge a nih an hre lo va ni. Mosia chuan an hnênah, “ Lalpa chaw pêk che u a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hei hi Lalpa thupêk chu a ni; mahni kham tâwk chiah chauh chhar ṭheuh rawh u; in ina awm zawng tân no hnih hisâpin chhar ang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Israel-te chuan chutiang chuan an ti ta a; ṭhenkhat chuan an chhar tam deuh va, ṭhenkhat erawh chuan an chhar tlêm deuh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nova an han teh chuan a chhar tam deuhte chuan an ngah bîk chuang lo va, a chhar tlêmte lahin an nei tlêm chuang bîk hek lo; mahni kham khawp chiah an chhar vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mosia chuan, “A tûka ei atân tiin tu man khêk suh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mosia thu chu an awih duh chuang lo va, ṭhenkhat chuan an ei bâng chu a tûka eiah an khêk a; mahse, a lung a, a ṭawih chhia a; Mosia chu an chungah a thinur hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tûk tin, mahni ei tâwk tûr chauh an chhar ta zêl a; ni a tlângsân chuan a tuiral vek ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A ni ruk ni chuan a lehhniha tamin, mi pakhat tân no li zêl hisâpin an chhar a ni. Pungkhâwmho chunga rorêltute chuan Mosia chu an rawn hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ani chuan an hnênah, “Hei hi Lalpa sawi kha a ni, naktûk hi ni serh, Lalpa tâna sabat thianghlim chu a ni. Vawiinah in ei duh zât chu hem hmin ula, chhum in duh zât chu chhûm rawh u; a bâng chu a tûk atân dah ṭha ang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mosia thupêk ang chuan a tûk atân an khêk chu a ṭawih lo va, a lung hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mosia chuan an hnênah, “Chu chu vawiin chuan ei rawh u, vawiin hi Lalpa sabat a ni a, khawiah mah chhar tûr in hmu lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ni ruk chhûngin tûk tin in chhar ang a, a ni sarih ni erawh chu sabat a ni a, pakhat mah chhar tûr a awm lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ni sarih ni chuan mi ṭhenkhat chu an thil chhar ṭhin chhar tûrin an thawk chhuak a; mahse, chhar tûr rêng an hmu lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Mosia hnênah, “Eng chen nge ka thupêk leh ka dânte hi in zawm duh loh dâwn?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kei Lalpa hian sabat ni ka siamsak che u a; chuvângin, a ni ruk niin in ei tûr ni hnih daih ka pe che u a ni; a ni sarih ni hi chuan mahni bûkah awm ṭheuh rawh u, tu mah kal chhuak suh u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tichuan, mite chu ni sarih ni chuan an châwl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Israel chhûngte chuan chu thil chu ‘Mana’ an vuah a, chhibung vâr chi ang hi a ni a, khawizu-a hmeh chhangpêr anga tui a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Mosia chuan, “ Lalpa thupêk chu hei hi a ni; in thlah zêlte hmuhah mana no khat dah ṭhat tûr a ni; Aigupta ram ata ka hruai chhuak che u a, thlalêra ka châwmna che u chaw a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Mosian Arona hnênah, “Bêl la la, Mana no khat dah rawh. Ṭhang lo thar zêlte hmuh atân Lalpa hmaah dah ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Mosia hnêna Lalpa thupêk ang chuan Arona chuan Lalpa hmaa thuthlung bâwmah chuan a dah ṭha a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Israel fate chuan mihring chênna ram, Kanan ram an thlen hma chu kum sawmli chhûng ngawt mana chu an ei a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tehna no sawmhnih hi ṭîn khat vêl a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel fa pungkhâwmho chu Sin thlalêr aṭang chuan Lalpa thupêk angin an insawn zêl a; Refidim-ah bûk an khuar a, mipui tân tui in tûr a awm lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mite chuan Mosia chu an nawr a, “Tui in tûr min pe rawh,” an ti a. Mite chuan Mosia chu an mawhchhiat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mite tui chu a hâl êm êm a, Mosia chungah an phunnawi a; “Engah nge tuihâla thi mai tûrin Aigupta ram aṭang khân kan fate leh kan rante nên min lo hruai chhuah le?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mosian Lalpa chu a au va, “Hêng mite tân hian eng nge ka tih tâk ang? Lungin min dêng hlum mai dâwn e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Mosia hnênah, “Israel upaho hruai la, Nail luipui i vuakna tiang kha kengin mipui hmaah kal ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />I hmaah Horeb tlânga lungpui bulah ka lo ding ang; lung chu i vua ang a, mipuite in tûr tui a lo chik chhuak ang,” a ti a. Israel upate hnênah Mosian chutiang chuan a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chu hmun hmingah chuan Maasa tih leh Meriba tih a sa a; Israel faten an nawr avâng leh, ‘Kan zîngah Lalpa a tel meuh nge tel meuh lo,’ tia Lalpa an fiah avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Refidim-ah chuan Amalek-ho an lo kal a, Israel-te chu an rawn bei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mosia chuan Josua hnênah, “Mi ṭhenkhat thlang la, Amalek-ho bei tûrin kal rawh. Naktûkah chuan tlângchhîpah Pathian tiang kengin ka lo ding ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mosia sawi ang chuan Josua chuan Amalek-ho chu a bei a; Mosia chu Arona leh Hura nên tlângchhîpah an chho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mosian a bân a han phar chuan Israel-ho chu an chak a, a bân a lâk thlâk chuan Amalek-ho chu an chak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mosia bân chu a kham ta hle a, lungtum an rawn la a, Mosia chu a chungah an ṭhuttîr a, Arona leh Hura chuan Mosia bân chu lehlam lehlamah an chelh kânsak a, ni tlâk hma chu a bân a phar thei ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amaleka leh a mite chu Josua chuan khandaihin a sawisa nek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Mosia hnênah, “He thu hi hriat reng atân lehkhabu-ah ziak rawh. Vân hnuaia tu ma hriat zui loh tûrin Amalek-ho chu ka sawisa dâwn tih Josua hrilh rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mosia chuan maichâm a siam a, a hmingah Lalpa Nisi a vuah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“ Lalpa puanzâr chu lek sâng rawh u; Lalpa chuan Amalek-ho chu eng lai pawhin a bei reng dâwn a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Midian-ho puithiam, Jethroa, Mosia puzawn chuan, Mosia leh a mite tâna Pathianin thil a tihsak, Lalpa ngeiin Israel-te Aigupta ram ata a hruai chhuah thute chu a lo hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mosia puzawn Jethroa chuan Mosia nupui Zipori, in lama a hnutchhiah kha, a fapa pahnih nên a rawn hruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A fapa upa zâwk chu Gersoma a ni, ‘ram dangah mikhual ka ni’ a tihna a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pakhat zâwk hming chu Eliezara a ni, ‘ka pate Pathian chuan min pui ta a, Farawa khandaih lakah min chhanhim’ a tihna a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian tlângah, bûk an khuarnaah chuan, Mosia puzawn chuan a fapa pahnih leh a nupui chu a rawn hruaisak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mosia hnênah, “Kei i puzawn, Jethroa hian ka rawn tlawh dâwn a che, i fapa pahnih leh i nupui pawh ka rawn hruai e,” a rawn ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mosia chu a puzawn hmuak tûrin a chhuak a, a kûn a, chibai a bûk a, an dam leh dam loh te an inzâwt a; puan inah chuan an lût dûn ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Israel-te avânga Farawa leh Aigupta mite chunga Lalpa thil tih zawng zawng chu Mosian a puzawn chu a hrilh a; kalkawnga harsatna an tawh laka Lalpa chuan a chhanhim ṭhin dânte pawh a hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aigupta mite kut ata leh Farawa kut ata Israel-te a chhan chhuak a, an chunga a ṭhat êm avângin Lalpa chungah chuan Jethroa chu a lâwm ta êm êm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Aigupta mite kut ata leh Farawa kut ata chhanchhuaktu che u Lalpa chu fakin awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Israel mite chuti taka hmusita an sawisak lai a chhan tâk avângin Lalpa chu pathian dang zawng zawng aiin a ropui zâwk tih ka hre ta,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mosia puzawn Jethroa chuan Pathian hnênah hâlral thilhlan leh inthawinate a hlân a. Arona leh Israel upa zawng zawngte chu Pathian hmaa Mosia puzawn inthawina chawhlui kîl tûr chuan an lo kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A tûkah chuan Mosia chu mite thu rem tûrin a ṭhu a, mite chuan Mosia chu zîng aṭangin tlai thlengin an din hual a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mosia puzawn chuan mipui ro a rêlsak dân chu a hmu a, “Engtizia nge mipui tân hetianga ro i rêl? Nangmah vekin rêl tumin i ṭhu a, zîng aṭanga tlai thlengin an din hual che hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mosian a puzawn hnênah chuan, “Pathian râwn tûrin mite hi ka hnênah an lo kal alâwm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thu pawi an neihin ka hnênah an rawn thlen miau si ṭhîn a, an ṭhenawmte nêna an inkâr thu ka lo rêl felsak ṭhîn a ni. Pathian thuruatte leh a dânte ka lo hrilh ṭhîn a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mosia puzawn chuan, “I thil tih dân hi a ṭha hauh lo mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nang leh hêng mite hi in intichau ngei ang; he hna hi i tân a hautak lutuk, nangmah mai chuan i thawk sêng lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka thu hi ngaithla la, thurâwn ka han pe ang che a, Pathianin a awmpui ang che. Mipui aiawha Pathian hnêna kala, an thu Pathian hnêna thlentu tûr i ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Pathian thuruatte leh a dânte chu i zirtîr ang a, an awm dân tûr leh an tih tûr i kawhhmuh ṭhîn tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mipui zîng ata mi fel deuh deuh, Pathian ṭih mi, thu dik ngaina, hlêprûk haw mi thlang chhuak la, sâng chin chunga rorêl tûr te, za chin chunga rorêl tûr te, sawmnga chin chunga rorêl tûr te, sâwm chin chunga rorêl tûr te ruat rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chûng chu rorêltu nghet ni rawh se, thu tênau chu rêl zêl sela, thu lian deuh erawh chu i hnên lo thleng ṭhîn rawh se; tichuan, an chhâwk zâng ang chia, i hahdam deuh thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Pathian thupêk anga chutianga i tih chuan i intichau lo vang a, mipui lah an zângkhai ang a, an thu an rem fel thuai thuai ang a, an haw mai thei ṭhîn ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tichuan, a puzawn thu chu Mosia chuan a zâwm a, a sawi ang chuan a ti ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Israel-te zînga a fel fel Mosian a thlang chhuak a, mipuite hotu-ah a ruat a; sâng hotu tûr te, za hotu tûr te, sawmnga hotu tûr te, sâwm hotu tûr te a ruat ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Eng lai pawhin mite chu ro an rêlsak a, thu lian erawh chu Mosia hnênah an thlen a, thu tenau chu an rêl fel mai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mosia chuan a puzawn chu a va thlah a, Jethroa chu an ram lamah a haw leh ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aigupta ram an chhuahsan aṭanga thla thumna, ni khat ni chuan, Israel fate chuan Sinai thlalêr an thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Refidim aṭanga lo thleng an ni, tlâng bul thlalêr ramah chuan bûk an khuar a, Mosia chu Pathian tâwk tûrin tlângah chuan a lâwn chho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tlâng aṭangin Lalpa chuan a rawn ko va, “Jakoba chhûngte bia la, Israel fate chu hrilh rawh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aigupta mite ka sawisak dân in hmu a, thla zârin mupuiin a notê a chawi angin ka chawi che u a, keima tân ka hruai chhuak che u a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chuvângin, ka aw in ngaihthlâk duh takmeuhva, ka thuthlung in vawn dâwn phawt chuan mi zawng zawng zînga ka ro hlu bîk in ni ang, khawvêl ram zawng zawng hi ka ta a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka tân hnam serh hran, puithiam in ni ang. Chûng chu Israel fate i hrilh tûr chu a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mosia chu tlâng ata chu a lo chhuk a, Israel upaho chu a ko va, Lalpa thupêk angin chûng thu chu a hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mi zawng zawng chuan, “ Lalpa sawi apiang chu kan ti ang,” an ti tlâng a. Mipui thu chu Mosian Lalpa a hrilh chhâwng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Mosia hnênah, “Ngai rawh, chhûm chhah takah i hnênah ka lo kal dâwn, i hnêna thu ka sawi lai miin an lo hria ang a, nang pawh kumkhuain an rin phah ang che,” a ti a. Mosian mipuite chhânna chu Lalpa a hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Mosia hnênah, “Mite hnênah kal la, vawiinah leh naktûkah anni chu thian thianghlim ang che; an silhfênte su fai sela.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A ni thum ni atân inpeih vek rawh se; a ni thum ni chuan mipui hmuh tûrin Sinai tlângah Lalpa chu a lo chhuk dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tlâng hualin ri i kham kualsak tûr a ni. Tlâng va rap lo tûrin fîmkhur rawh se; a bul hnaiah pawh kal suh u; tlâng va rap chu tihhlum tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chumi chin chu tu man an khawih tûr a ni lo; lunga den hlum emaw, thala kah hlum tûr emaw a ni; hei hian mihring pawh ran pawh a huam a ni; tihhlum tûr an ni. Nimahsela, tawtawrâwt a rîk hunah mipui chuan tlâng chu an lo thleng tûr a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mosia chu tlâng aṭang chuan a chhuk a, mipui chu a thian thianghlim a, an silhfênte chu an su fai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mipui hnênah, “Ni thum ni atân inpeih rawh u, in nupuite bulah mu suh ang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A ni thum ni zîngah chuan khawpui a ri dur dur a, kâwlte a phe a, tlâng chu chhûm chhah takin a khuh tlat a; tawtawrâwt a ri ruai ruai bawk a, mi zawng zawng chu hlauvin an khûr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pathian tâwk tûrin mite chu bûk aṭang chuan Mosia chuan a hruai chhuak a, tlâng bulṭhutah chuan an ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Sinai tlângah Lalpa chu mei nên a lo chhuk avângin a khu vung vung a, rawhtuina meipui khu ang maiin a khu a, tlâng chu a nghîng hluk hluk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tawtawrâwt chu a ri ring tial tial a, Mosia chuan thu a sawi a. Pathian chuan khawpui riin a rawn chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lalpa chu Sinai tlângchhîpah chuan a lo chhuk a; tlângchhîpa chho tûrin Mosia chu Lalpa chuan a ko va; Mosia chu a chho ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Mosia hnênah, “Chhuk la, Lalpa hmêl hmuh tumin mipuiin ri kham kha rawn kân suh se, an kân vaih chuan mi tam tak an thi ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lalpa hmaa kal ṭhîn puithiamte pawh an inthian thianghlim tûr a ni; chutilo chu, ka rawn hrem ngei ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mosia chuan Lalpa hnênah, “Mipuite chuan Sinai tlâng an rap thei hlei nêm, ‘tlâng hualin ri kham ula, serh thianghlim rawh u,’ min tih kha,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Lalpa chuan a hnênah, “Chhuk ta la, Arona nên lo chho leh rawh u; puithiamte leh mipuite chuan ri kham khu Lalpa panin rawn kân suh se; an kân chuan ka lo sawisa mai ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tichuan, Mosia chu mipui awmnaah chuan a chhuk a, chûng thu chu a hrilh a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian chuan thu a sawi a, a sawite chu hêngte hi a ni:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Bawiha in awmna Aigupta ram aṭanga hruai chhuaktu che u Lalpa , in Pathian chu ka ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kei lo hi chu Pathian dang rêng rêng nei suh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />I tân milem siam suh, chung lam vâna awm emaw, leia awm emaw lei hnuai tuia thil awm lem emaw i siam tûr a ni hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chûng chu kûnin chibai i bûk tûr a ni lo va, an rawng i bâwl tûr a ni hek lo. Kei Lalpa i Pathian hi Pathian thîkthuchhe tak ka ni, min hawtute chu an thlah chhuan thum chhuan li thleng pawhin ka hrem ṭhîn a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />min hmangaiha ka thupêk zâwmtute erawh chu an thlah chhuan sâng tam tak chungah pawh ngil ka nei ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />I Pathian, Lalpa hming chhâlin dâwt sawi suh; dâwta a hming chhâltu chu Pathianin hrem lohvin a chhuah lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sabat ni hi thianghlim taka serh tûr a ni tih hre reng rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ni ruk chhûng hna i thawk ang a, i hna zawng zawng i thawk thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A ni sarih ni erawh hi chu Lalpa tâna sabat ni a ni a, hna eng mah i thawk tûr a ni lo; i fapa te, i fanu te, i bawihpa te, i bawihnu te, i ran te, in khaw chhûnga hnam dang awm te pawhin hna an thawk tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalpa pawhin ni rûk chhûngin tuifinriat te, lei leh vân leh a chhûnga awm zawng zawng te a siam a, a ni sarih ni chuan a châwl a ni. Chuvângin, mal a sâwm a, a serh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />I nu leh i pa chawimawi rawh; tichuan, Lalpa i Pathianin ram a pêk che-ah chuan i dam rei dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tual that suh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Uire suh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ru suh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />I vêngte dâwtin hêk suh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />I vêngte in leh lo awt suh; i ṭhian nupui pawh ît suh, a bawihpa emaw, a bawihnu emaw, a bâwng emaw, a sabengtung emaw, a neih eng mah i awt tûr a ni lo,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mipui chuan kâwlphe te, tawtawrâwt rite an hriata, kâwlphe te, tlânga meikhu vung vung te an hmuh chuan hlauvin an khûr a, hla fêah an ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mosia hnênah, “Kan hnênah thu sawi la, kan lo ngaithla ang e, Pathian meuh chuan kan hnênah thu sawi teh suh se, kan thi mai dâwn alâwm,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mosia chuan, “Hlau suh u, Pathian chu in ṭih renga, a thu sawi in awih reng dâwn leh dâwn loh fiah tûr che uin a lo kal mai a ni e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mosia chuan Pathian awmna chu a va hnaih a, mipui erawh chu hla fêah an ding ta tlat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Mosia hnênah, “Vân aṭangin ka rawn bia che tih Israel-te chuan an hria a, hetiang hian hrilh rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tangkaruain emaw, rangkachakin emaw in tân kei bâk biak tûr siam suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Min biakna hmun tûr ka ruat apiangah ka tân hlum maichâm siam ula, chutah chuan hâlral thilhlan leh remna thilhlan berâm leh bâwngte chu hlân ang che u, ka lo kal ang a, mal ka sâwm ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ka tâna lung maichâm in siam chuan chher suh ang che u, in chher chuan in thîrkhen avângin a bawrhbâng tawh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Kailâwn siam ngai khawpa sângin maichâm siam hek suh u, in lâwn chhoh zawngin in lang palh ang e,” tiin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Hêng dânte hi Israel-te zawm atân pe rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hebrai mi bawihah an lei chuan kum ruk chhûng bawihah a ṭang ang a, a kum sarih kum chuan man lova chhuah tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amah maia lei a nih chuan amah chu a chhuak ang a, a nupui nêna lei a nih chuan a nupui nên chuan an chhuak tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A puin nupui a neihsaka, fanu fapa an hrin chuan, a nupui fanaute chu a pu ta an ni; ani erawh chu amah chauhvin a chhuak thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />‘Ka pu hi ka ngaina a, ka nupui fanaute ka hmangaih bawk si a, ka chhuahsan lo mai ang,’ a tih tlat chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />a pu chuan Pathian inah a rawn hruai ang a, kawngkaah, kawngka biang bulah chuan a dintîr ang a, thîr zumin a beng a verhsak ang a, kumkhuain bawih a ni tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Miin a fanu bawihan hralh sela, mipa anga chhuah ve tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A nupui atâna lei a niha, a duh leh si lo a nih chuan, a pa chu a tlantîr leh tûr a ni; a bum avângin mi dang hnêna a hralh a thiang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A fapa nupui atân lei a nih chuan a fanu angin a en tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A fapa chu nupui dang a neihsak chuan a nupui lei hmasak chu a châwm man te, a silhfên man te leh a chan ai thil dangte pawh a tihtlêmsak tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hêng thil pathum hi a tihsak loh chuan man lovin a chhuah tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Miin mi dang vua sela, a vuaka chu a thih chuan ani pawh chu tihhlum ngei tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tum rêng ni lova vaw hlum palh a nih chuan a tân himna tûr hmun ka ruatah chuan a sa him nân tlân rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Him nân ka maichâmah tlân suh se, thinura, tum râna mi dang that chu hnuh chhuaha, tihhlum tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Mahni nu chungah emaw, pa chungah emaw kutthlâk chu tihhlum tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Hralh atân emaw, ama bawih atân emaw mihring rutu chu tihhlum tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“A nu emaw, a pa emaw ânchhia lawhtu chu tihhlum tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Mi insual sela, pakhat zâwk chuan lungtumin chhu sela emaw, kuttumin emaw hnek sela, a thih loh chuan hrem tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Sila khum beta a nata, tiang hawla khawlai a lên leh theih chuan a sil chhûnga a tha ai chu a tisiltu chuan a dam vâr thlengin a rûl tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Miin a bawihpa emaw, a bawihnu emaw tiangin vua se, a vuak hlum chuan hrem ngei tûr a ni,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />ni hnih khat a dam erawh chuan an pu chu hrem tûr a ni lo, sum a chân ta tihna a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Mi an insuala, hmeichhe nau pai an khawih chuan, amah chu hliam lo mah se a nau pai chu a tlâk chuan hmeichhe pasal phût zât, rorêltu remtihpuiin chawitîr tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hmeichhia chuan hliam a tuar chuan nun aiah nun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />mit aiah mit, hâ aiah hâ, kut aiah kut, ke aiah ke,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />mei kan aiah mei kan, hliam aiah hliam, vuak aiah vuak tuartîr tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Miin a bawihpa mit emaw, a bawihnu mit emaw vuak delsak sela, a mit chhiat manah a chhuah tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />An hâ a tihbalsak pawhin an ha manah a chhuah tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Bâwngpain mipa pawh, hmeichhia pawh si hlum sela, bâwng chu lunga den hlum tûr a ni, a sa chu ei tûr a ni lo; bâwng neitupa chu khawih zui tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Bâwng chuan mi sîk a lo chîna, a neitupa chu an lo hrilh tawh ṭhina, thlung ṭha duh lova, mipa emaw, hmeichhia emaw a sîk hlum chuan bâwng chu lunga den hlum tûr a ni; a neitupa pawh tihhlum tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“Amaherawhchu, a neitupa chu a nun tlan an phalsak chuan a nun tlanna tûr an tuk zât zât chu a pe tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Bâwng chuan naupang, mipa emaw, hmeichhia emaw si hlum sela, puitling si hlum ang bawka rêl tûr a ni,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />bawihpa emaw bawihnu emaw si hlum sela, a neitu chuan tangka bûk sawmthum a chawi tûr a ni, a situ bâwng pawh den hlum tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />“Miin khur chhîn a hawn emaw, khur thar a laihin emaw, a chhin leh lohva, bâwngpa emaw, sabengtung emaw a tlâk hlum chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />khur laitu chuan a chawi tûr a ni; a man a pêk hnuah erawh chuan a sa chu a nei thei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />“Mi pakhat bâwngpa mi dang bâwngpain a tihhlum chuan a tihlumtu bâwngpa chu hralh tûr a ni, a man chu an insem ang a, a thi sa pawh an insem tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />“Bâwngpa chuan tûn hmaa mi sîk a chîn ṭhina, a neitu chuan thlung ṭha lo ni sela, a sîk hlum bâwngpa chu bâwngpa vêkin a rûl tûr a ni, a sa erawh chu a nei thei ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Miin bâwngpa emaw, berâm emaw a rûka, a talh emaw, a hralh emaw a nih chuan bâwngpa chu a lêt ngain a rûl ang a, berâm chu a lêt liin a rûl tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A thil rûk chu a rûl ngei tûr a ni, rulhna a neih loh chuan a thil rûk rulh nân amah chu bawiha hralh tûr a ni. Bâwngpa emaw, sabengtung emaw, berâm emaw a rûk chu an la dam chuan a leh hnihin a rûl tûr a ni. “Rûkru, zâna lût chu lo manin lo vaw hlum pawh ni se tual that a tling lo. Ni chhuah hnua tih a nih erawh chuan tual that a tling a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Miin a ran a chhuaha, mi lovah emaw, grep hmunah emaw tla-in mi lova thlai chu ei chhia sela, a ei chhiat zât chu a ran neitupa chuan ama thlaiin emaw, grepin emaw a rûl tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Miin ramah mei chhêm sela, ram kâng chuan mi lo kâng kaiin buh ding lai emaw, zai tawh dah khâwm emaw kâng sela, mei chhuahtu chuan a kâng chhia chu a rûl tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Miin mi dang pawisa emaw, thil man tam tham emaw kawlsak sela, a kawl chhûng chuan bo ta sela, rûkru tih a niha, rûkru chu man a nih chuan a rutu chuan a lêt hnihin a rûl tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A rutu man a nih loh erawh chuan a kawltu chu rorêltu hmaah hruai tûr a ni a, a ru lo tih hriat nân chhia a chhamtîr tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Thil inchuh rêng rêng, bâwngpa emaw, silhfên emaw, thil hloh chhar emaw a inchuhate chu rorêltu hmaa hruai tûr a ni. Rorêltuin thiam zâwka a ruat chu a thiam lo zâwk chuan a lêt hnih a pe tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Miin sabengtung emaw, bâwngpa emaw, berâm emaw, ran dang emaw, a ṭhianpa enkawltîr sela, lo thi palhin emaw, hliam emaw lo tuarin emaw, suamhmang rualin an chhuhsak emaw ni sela, hretu dang an awm si loh chuan
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />a kawltu chu biak inah hruai tûr a ni, a ṭhianpa ran chu a rûk a ni lo tih hriat nân chhia a chham tûr a ni. Ran chu a rûk a nih loh chuan a neitu khân a chân mai ang a, a kawltu khân a rulh a ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A rûk a nih erawh chuan a rûl tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sa seh a nih chuan a ei bâng ṭhenkhat, sa seh a nih hriatna a rawn la tûr a ni, sa seh chu a rulh a ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Miin mi dang ran a chhawr hawha, a neitu hmuh lohva inhliam emaw, thi palh emaw a nih chuan a hawhtu chuan a rûl tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A neitu chuan a hmuh ve reng erawh chuan a rulh a ngai lo. Man neia hawh a nih pawhin, a hawh man chuan a huam a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Nula hnahkhat, tu ma la hual loh miin a ngaih chuan, nupui man pangngai a pe ang a, nupuiah a nei tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nula pain neih a phal tlat loh pawhin nula hnahkhat man pangngai a pe tho tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Mitthi thlûk chîng hmeichhia chu tihhlum tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Ran rîmtu chu tihhlum tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“ Lalpa hnênah ni lo, pathian dang hnêna inthawi chu tihboral daih tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“In zînga hnam dang awm vete in tinawmnahin in tiduhdah tûr a ni lo; nangni pawh Aigupta ramah mikhuala in awm kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hmeithai emaw, fahrah emaw in tinawmnah tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />In tihduhdah vaih chuan kei Lalpa hian an mangang au chu ka lo ngaithla ang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />ka thin a ur ang a, khandaiha sah hlum in ni ngei ang; in nupuite chu an hmeithai ang a, in fate pawh an fahrah ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Ka mite chu an retheih avânga tangka i pûktîr chuan tangka pûktîrtu dangte angin ti suh; a pung i ṭhîng tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />I vêngte puan dahkhama i hrên chuan ni a tlâkah i pe kîr leh tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A mut huna intuamlumna a neih chhun a ni a; i pêk kîr loh chuan a mangang ka hnênah a lo au vang a, ka lo chhâng ngei ang, ka khawngaih ngei dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Pathian ânkhum suh; in chunga rorêltu pawh ânchhia lawh suh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“I thlai rah i seng zawhah, oliv hriak i sâwr zawh chuan min pêk tûr ang chu min pe thuai ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“I fapa hrin hmasak ber chu min pe tûr a ni. Chutiang bawkin i bâwng leh berâm no neih hmasak ber chu min pe tûr a ni; a pui hnute ni sarih a hne ang a, a ni riat ni chuan mi rawn pe tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Ka mite in ni a, in thianghlim tûr a ni; chuvângin, rama sa seh sa rêng rêng in ei tûr a ni lo, ui pe ang che u.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Dâwt thuthang mai mai pu darh suh la; mi sual chhan tûrin thu dik lo sawi suh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thil sual ti tûr chuan, a tam lam pawh ni se, zui suh la; dâwta mi dang thiam loh an chantîrnaah pawh tel hek suh la,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />rorêlna hmunah mi rethei ṭan bîk suh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“I hmêlma bâwngpa emaw, sabengtung emaw tlân bo i hmuh chuan i kaih hâwnsak ngei tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />I mi huatzâwng tak pawh ni se a sabengtung chu a phurin lo delh sela, i kaihthawhsak tûr a ni, i kal pêl mai tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Mi rethei pawh, a thu chu dik takin i ngaihtuahsak tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Dâwtin mi hek suh la, thiam lohna nei lo chu tihlum suh; chutiang ti apiang chu thiam loh ka chantîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thamna la suh, thamna chuan thil dik lakah mit a tidel ṭhîn a, mi dikte thu pawh a tichingpen ṭhîn,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ram dang mi i tiduhdah tûr a ni lo; nang pawh Aigupta ramah khân ram dang mi i ni tawh a, a hrehawmzia i hriat kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“I lo chu kum ruk Chhûng nei la, a thar apiang seng ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A kum sarih kum erawh chuan i chawlhtîr tûr a ni. Chumi kum chhûnga seng tûr awm chu i hauh tûr a ni lo. Mi retheiten an chang ve tûr a ni; mi retheiho lâk bâng chu ramsain an tlân tûr a ni. Chutiang bawkin i grep leh oliv hmun chu i ti tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Ni ruk chhûng hna thawk la, a ni sarih ni erawh chuan i châwl tûr a ni; i bâwng te, i sabengtungte pawh an châwl tûr a ni. I bawihnute leh hnam dang hlawha i chhawrte pawh an châwl hahdam tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“In hnêna ka sawi apiang pawisa rawh u, Pathian dang hming rêng rêng lam suh u, a sawi pawh sawi ri suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Min chawimawi nân kum khatah vawi thum kût hmang rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Abib thla, ka hun ruatah, chhang dawidim telh loh kût hmang ula, ni sarih chhûng dawidim telh loh chhang ei ang che u. Hemi hun hian Aigupta ram ata in lo chhuak a; chuvângin, ka hmaah tu mah kut ruakin in lo kal tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thlai thar hmasa thlai thar kût hmang ula, kum tâwpah in thil chîn zawng zawng in seng zawh hunah Pâwl Kût hmang bawk ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />In zînga mipa zawng zawng kum khatah vawi thum Lalpa Pathian hmaah in lo lang tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Dawidim telh chhang chu ka hnênah i thilhlan ran thisen nên i hlân tûr a ni lo. Inthawina ran hlan thau chu a tûk thlenga dah tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />In rama thlai rah hmasa, a ṭha ṭha chu, Lalpa i Pathian inah i rawn la tûr a ni. Kêlnote chu a pui hnutein chhûm suh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Ngai teh, kawnga vêng tûr che leh ka hmun ruata hruai thleng tûr chein in hmahruaitu tûr vântirhkoh ka tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A thu pawisa ula, ngaithla ṭhîn rawh u; ka tirh a ni asin. Amah chu dodâl suh u; chutilo chuan in bawhchhiatnate a ngaidam lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“A thu in zawma ka sawi zawng zawng hi in tih chuan in hmêlmate hmêlma, a dotu che u dotu ka ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ka vântirhkoh chuan in hma a hruai ang a, Amor mi te, Hit mi te, Periz mi te, Kanan mi te, Hiv mi te, Jebus mi te ramah a hruai lût ang che u: anni chu ka tiboral dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />An pathiante chu kûnin chibai in bûk ve tûr a ni lo va, an tih ang in ti ve tûr a ni hek lo; an pathiante chu in tichhe vek tûr a ni a; an thil phunte pawh tichhe vek ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Lalpa , in Pathian chu chibai min bûk chuan ruahtuiah leh buhbâlah mal ka sâwm ang che u a, in zîng ata natna ka la bo bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />In rama nu tu mahin nau an chhiat lo vang a, ching an awm hek lo vang; in nun pawh ka tisei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“In kalna tûr mite chu ka tithlabâr ang a, an chiai ang a, in hmêlmate chu in hmaah ka tlânchhiattîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />An hmaah khawinghal ka tîr ang a, Hiv mi te, Kanan mi te, Hit mi te chu an ûm darh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kum khat chhûng maiin ka hnawt chhuak vek lo vang; an chhuah mai chuan engkim a ram chhe hman ang a, in tâna hnawk tham ram sakawlh pawh an pung hman ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ram pum luah tham in awm hma chu zawi zawiin ka hnawt chhuak chauh vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />In ram chu Tuipui Sen aṭanga Filistia-ho tuifinriat inkâr leh, thlalêr aṭanga Eufretis lui inkâr hi a ni ang. Chu rama chêngte chu in hneh vek ang a, ka hnawh chhuahtîr ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Anni nên chuan thu in thlung tûr a ni lo, an pathiante pawh in ṭâwm tûr a ni hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />In ramah chuan hêng mite hi in awmtîr tûr a ni lo; ka lakah thil sual an tihtîr dah ang che u; an pathiante chibai in bûk ve vaih chuan in chhiatpui ang.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Mosia hnênah, “Arona te, Nadaba te, Abihua te leh Israel upa sawmsarih te kha ka hnênah rawn chhohpui la; hla fea dingin chibai mi bûk tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nang erawh chu ka hmaah, nangmah chauhvin i lo kal tûr a ni, mipui phei chu an lo chho ve tûr a ni lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mosia chu a lo chhuk a. Lalpa thu sawi leh an invawn dân tûra a ruat chu a hrilh vek a, mi zawng zawng chuan “ Lalpa sawi chu kan ti ang,” tiin an chham rual dual dual a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mosia chuan Lalpa thu zawng zawng chu a ziak chhuak a, zîng takah a tho va, tlâng bulṭhutah chuan maichâm a siam a. Israel hnam zâtin lung sâwm leh pahnih a phun a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Israel fate zînga tlangvâl ṭhenkhat chu a tîr a, Lalpa hnênah hâlral thilhlan leh remna thilhlan bâwngpa an hlân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chûng thisen zâtve chu Mosia chuan chawhtawlhah a dah a, a zâtve chuan maichâm chu a theh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thuthlung ziakna bu chu a la a, mipui hriatah a chhiar a; anni chuan, “ Lalpa sawi chu kan ti ang a, kan zâwm ang e,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mosia chuan thisen chu a la a, mipui chu a theh a, “Ngai teh u, Lalpa chuan hêng thu ang hian nangni nên thu a thlung ta, hei hi a thuthlunna thisen a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Mosia te, Arona te, Nadaba, te Abihua te leh Israel upa sawmsarih te chu tlângah chuan an han chho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Israel-te Pathian chu an han hmu a. A ke hnuaiah chuan lungmantam safir rem khâwm ang, vân anga thiang hi a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Israel milianho chungah chuan kut a thlâk lo, Pathian chu an han hmu a, an eiin an in ho va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Mosia hnênah, “Tlângah ka hnênah lo chho la, i mi hruaite i zirtîr atân ka dân leh thupêkte ka ziakna lungphêk ka lo pe ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mosia leh amah puitu Josua chu an chhuak a, Mosia chu Pathian awmna tlângah chuan a chho ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Israel upate hnênah chuan, “Kan lo kîr leh hma chu he laiah hian min lo nghâk reng rawh u. Thu eng emaw nei in awm pawhin, hei, Arona leh Hura te in zîngah an awm a, an hnênah thlen ang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mosia chu tlângah chuan a chho ta a. Tlângah chuan chhûm a zîng phui tlat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lalpa ropuina chu tlângah chuan a châm reng a, ni ruk chhûng chu tlâng chu chhûmin a tuam hnuin a ni sarih ni chuan Mosia chu a rawn ko va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tlângchhîpa Pathian ropuina chu Israel-te hmuhah chuan mit tidel thei khawpa êng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mosia chu chhûmah chuan a han lût a, tlângah chuan a chho va, tlângah chuan ni sawmli a han awm a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Mosia hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Israel fate chu thilpêk ka hnêna rawn hlân tûrin hrilh rawh. An phal ang ang rawn la rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Rangkachak te, tangkarua te, dâr te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />la dumpâwl te leh a sen te, la senlâr leh zai sîn te, kêl hmul te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />berâm vun tihsen te, savun ṭha chi te; sitim thing te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />chhit atân hriak te, hriak thiha telh tûr leh hâla telh tûr thil rimtui te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Efod leh âwmbela bel tûr Soham lung leh lungmantam te rawn keng rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />An zînga ka chên ve theih nân biakbûk min siamsak rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Biakbûk chu a chhûng chei dân tûr nên lam a lem ka entîr che kha, khami ang chiah khân in sa tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Sitim thingin bâwm, a dung tawng hnih leh a chanve, a vâng tawng khat leh a chanve, a sân lam tawng khat leh a chanve in siam tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A pâwn lam leh chhûng lam chu rangkachak ṭha chiin in luan ang a, a tlâng chu rangkachak hlang ngatin in tuam chhuak bawk tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Rangkachak beng pali siam ula, a ke pali-ah chuan vuah ang che u, lehlam lehlamah beng pahnih ve ve vuah ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sitim thingtlâwn pahnih siam ula, rangkachakin luan bawk rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sitim thingtlâwn chu bâwm zâwn nân a sîr bengah chuan rawlh ve ve ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thingtlâwn chu bâwmah chuan vuah reng tûr a ni a, lak sawn tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lungphêka thupêk ziak ka pêk tûr che chu a chhûngah dah ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bâwm khuhna atân a dung tawng hnih leh a chanve, a vâng tawng khat leh a chanve, rangkachak hlîr phêk siam la.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cherub lem pahnih, rangkachaka siam, a chhera chher ngei, a chhîn hmâwr tawna dah tûr siam bawk ang che;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />a chhîn rangkachak nên a hmâwra rangkachak cherub lem awm chu sakhat a ni tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cherub-te chu an inhawitawn ang a, an thla an zâr ang a, bâwm chhîn chu a khuh vek tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bâwm chhûngah lungphêk pahnih ka pêk tûr che chu dah la, a chhîn chuan i khuh dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Bâwm bulah chuan kan intâwk ṭhîn ang a, cherub pahnih, Thuthlung Bâwm chunga awm inkâr aṭang chuan ka rawn bia ang che a, Israel-te hnêna thu ka pêk tûr zawng zawng chu ka rawn hrilh ṭhîn ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Sitim thingphêkin dawhkân i siam bawk tûr a ni; a dung tawng hnih, a vâng tawng khat, a sân lam tawng khat leh a chanve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Rangkachak hlangin luan chhuak la, a tlâng chu rangkachakin kâwm rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Zung li bawka hlai a sîr kâwmna siam la, a tlâng chu rangkachakin kâwm rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Rangkachak beng pali siam bawk la, a ke awmna kilah vuah thliah ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A zâwnfung rawlhna tûr beng chu a tlâng kâwmna bulah dah ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Thing tlâwn, zâwnfung tûr, siam la, rangkachak luan ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Thlêng te, bêl te, uain thâwl te, uain bunna tûr note rangkachak hlangin siam tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Dawhkân chu Thuthlung Bâwm bulah hûn tûr a ni. Ka hmaa dawhkânah chuan chhang serh a awm reng tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Khâwnvâr dahna rangkachak hlîr hlakin i siam tûr a ni. A ngul leh a bul vâwng chu a chhera chher tûr a ni; a lu bâwk te, a chei mawina pangpâr kuhmûm leh pâr parh lemte nên chuan a inzawm vek tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A kûngpui pêng aṭangin zâr paruk a pêng ang a, lehlam lehlamah zâr pathum ve ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Zâr tinah a cheimawi nân theite pâr kuhmûm leh a pâr parh lem pathum zêl a awm tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />khâwnvâr ngul zidingah chuan a cheimawina theite pâr kuhmûm leh pâr parh lem pali a awm tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />A zâr chung zâwk leh hnuai zâwk inkârah pangpâr kuhmûm pakhat zêl a awm bawk tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Pangpâr kuhmûm lem te, a zârte leh a zidingte chu rangkachak tlang sakhat aṭanga chher tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Khâwnvâr zâr sarih lu bâwkte chu chhit tûrin siam la, han chhit chuan a hma lam ên rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Khâwnvâr chhit vêl nâna hman tûr bakcheh leh meivâp dahna thlêng, rangkachak hlang hlakin siam bawk tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Khâwnvâr bâwr leh a hmanruate siam nân rangkachak hlîr hlak kg. sawmthum leh panga hmang ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tlânga a lem ka entîr che ang chiah khân uluk takin siam ang che.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“La zai sîn thlûr leh a dumpâwl te, a senduk te, a senlâr tea tah Cherub lem mawi taka zeh puan sâwm, Biakbûk chhûngah chuan zâr ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Puanzâr chu a intiat vek tûr a ni, tawng sawmhnih leh pariata sei, tawng li-a hlai a ni tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Panga chu a hlai zâwnga ṭhui zawm tûr a ni a, a dang panga pawh chu a hrana ṭhui zawm bawk tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Panga ṭhui zawm sîr ber tlângah chuan a beng, la dumpâwl hrual vuah thliah tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Beng sawmnga ve ve, inzâwn thliaha vuah tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A beng leh beng bah zawmna tûr thil kawm sawmnga rangkachakin siam la, chu chuan puan ṭhui khâwm pahnih chu bât zawm ang che; tichuan, Biakbûk chung zâr chu tlêp khat a ni dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Biakbûk chung tûr kêl hmul puan sâwm leh pakhat tah tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kêl hmul puan chu a intiat vek tûr a ni, tawng sawmthuma sei, tawng li-a hlai ni rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chûng puan panga chu ṭhui zawm tûr a ni, a dang paruk pawh chu a hranga ṭhui zawm tûr a ni. Paruk ṭhui zawm chu biakbûk hma lamah zâr tûr a ni, a sîr ber chu thleh tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ṭhui khâwm sîr ber tlângah chuan beng sawmnga, inzâwn zêlin siam tawn bawk ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Dârin thil kawm siam la, chu chuan bât tawn la, biakbûk in chung zâr chu tlêp khat a ni dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Biakbûk hnung lamah a khuhna sahmul puan lawr chu uai thla mai rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A sîr tuaka a chunga lawr, tawng khat ve ve pawh chu uai thla mai rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“A chung thuah belhna tûr berâm vun tihsen leh savun ṭha chi siam bawk ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Biakbûk banga tun tûr sitim thing rem khâwm ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tawng sâwma sâng, tawng khat leh a chanvea hlaiin rem ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Frêm pahnih ke chu inang chiahin tizuih la, a bulṭhuta a zu invuah hnuah a dangte nên a insi phui thei tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chhim lam bang atân chutiang remkhâwm chu sawmhnih siam la,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />a bulṭhut, a sîr zuih zu inphunna tûr tangkaraw tlang ker khuar, tlang sawmhnih siam bawk ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Biakbûk hmâr lama tun tûr chutiang sitim thing rem khâwm chu sawmhnih siam bawk ang che,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />a frêm ke zuih inphunna tûr tangkaraw tlang sawmli ker bawk la, tah chuan zu inphun rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Biakbûk châr, khawthlang lamah chuan bang tun tûr thing rem khâwm paruk siam la,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />pahnih chu a kila ṭang tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A kila ṭang tûrte chu a bul aṭangin a lêr thlengin kilh zawm tûr a ni, a kil bang tûr chu chutianga kilh zawm tûr chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tichuan, a vaiin thing rem khâwm chu pariat a ni ang a, a bulṭhut ṭheuh tûr pawh tangkaraw tlang ker khuar bawk tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A bang tun ṭhui khâwm tûr, bangrel, sitim thingtlâwn sâwm leh panga siam la.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A bangah chuan rel panga awm zêl rawh se, a châr lamah panga, a sîr tuakah panga ve ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A laia a rel dah chuan Biakbûk bang chu a hual chhuak tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Thing rem khâwm tun chu rangkachaka luan vek tûr a ni; a ṭhuikhâwmna tûr bangrel vuah nân rangkachak beng siam bawk ang che, a bangrelte pawh chu rangkachaka luan tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Biakbûk chu tlânga a lem ka entîr che ang chiah khân din ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Pindana zâr tûr la zai sîn, a dumpâwl te, a senduk te, a senlâr tea tahin cherub lemte zeh tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Rangkachaka luan sitim ban siam la, a innghahna tûr tangkaraw tlang siam bawk ang che. Banah chuan thil bahna tûr kawm siam la, puan chu zâr ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Puanzâr pindan chhûngah chuan Thuthlung Bâwm chu dah la, puanzâr chu Hmun Thianghlim Ber leh Hmun Thianghlim daidanna a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Thuthlung Bâwm chu a chhîn chuan i chhîn ang a, Hmun Thianghlim Berah chuan dah ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Puanzâr pâwn lamah dawhkân kha hmâr lam pangah dah la, khâwnvâr kha chhim lam pangah dah ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />“Biakbûk kawngkaa zâr tûr la zai sîn, thlûr, a dumpâwl te, a senduk te, a senlâr te mawi taka tah tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Chumi zârna tûr chuan sitim ban panga, rangkachaka luan, a bulṭhut dâr tlang ker khuar leh puan bahna tûr thil kawm rangkachakin siam bawk ang che.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Maichâm, kil li nei, tawng nga bial, sitim thingin siam ang che; tawng thuma sâng a ni tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A kil tinah ki lawr chho a awm ṭheuh tûr a ni, maichâm nên chuan a inzawm vek tûr a ni; a vaiin dâr phêka tuam vek tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Vut bâwm te, vutlawh te, maihûn te, thîrkut te, meilawh te dârin siam bawk ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Dâr tlâwn rem khâwm, a pangah chuan bel chhuak la, a kil li-ah chuan dâr beng dah zêl ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chu dâr tlâwn rem khâwm chuan maichâm hnuai lam chanve thlengin a tuam tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A zâwnfung tûr sitim tlâwn siam la, dârin tuam ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Zâwnfung pahnih chu maichâm panga beng chuan zâwn dâwnah vuah tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Maichâm bangah thingphel bel la, a lai chu kawrawng rawh se; tlânga a lem ka entîr che ang khân siam ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Biakbûk chu hung tûr a ni. Chhim lamah chuan la zai sîn thlûra tah puan tawng zaa sei zâr tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Dâr ban sawmhnih leh a bulṭhut dâr tlang sawmhnih a awm tûr a ni. Banah chuan puanzâr bahna tûr thil kawm leh a zârna tûr thil tlâwn, tangkaruaa siam, dah bawk tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Biakbûk hmâr lamah pawh puan tawng zaa sei zâr tûr a ni, ban sawmhnih leh a bulṭhut sawmhnih, a bahna tûr kawm leh a zârna tûr thil tlâwn, tangkaruaa siam a awm bawk tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khawthlang lamah chuan tawng sawmngaa sei puan zâr tûr a ni, ban sâwm leh a bulṭhut sâwm a awm ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khawchhak lamah pawh a hungna chu tawng sawmngaa sei a ni bawk tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Luhna tûr kawngka a awm ang a, luhna sîr bang chu tawng sâwm leh pangaa sei a ni ang, ban pathum leh bulṭhut pathum a nei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A luhna lehlam sîrah pawh bang, tawng sâwm leh pangaa sei, ban pathum leh bulṭhut pathum nei a awm bawk tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A luhna kawngkaa zâr tûr la zai sîn thlûr, a dumpâwl te, a senduk te, a senlâr tea tah, mawi taka zeh, tawng sawmhniha sei a awm tûr a ni; a zârna atân ban pali, bulṭhut nei ṭheuh a awm bawk tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hungna ban zawng zawng chu tangkaraw tlâwna ṭhui zawm tûr a ni: puan bahna tûr thil kawm chu tangkarua a ni tûr a ni, a bulṭhut erawh chu dâr tlang a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A tual hungna chu a dung tawng za, a vâng tawng sawmnga, a sân lam tawng nga a ni ang a, a puanzâr tûr chu la zai sîn thlûr tah a ni ang, a ban bul erawh chu dâr a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Biakbûk sakna hmanrua zawng zawng, a kilh behna te, a hungna pal khen nghehna te chu dâr vek a ni tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Khâwnvâra chhit tûr oliv hriak thlit fîm rawn la tûrin Israel fate chu hrilh rawh; khâwnvâr chu tlaiah chhit ziah tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Arona leh a fate chuan Biakbûka Thuthlung Bâwm awmna pâwnah khâwnvâr chu dah sela, tlai aṭanga zîng thlengin Lalpa hmaah chuan chhi rawh se; Israel fate leh an thlah zêlte chuan hei hi tih dân nghetah neih rawh se.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“I u Arona chu a fa Nadaba te, Abihua te, Eleazara te, Ithamara te nên ko la, Israel mite zîng ata ka puithiam atân tihrang rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />I u, Arona hâk tûr, kawr serh, amah tiropuia timawitu tûr siamsak ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi themthiam, pianpuia themthiamna ka pêkte chu ruai la, Arona inbel tûr thawmhnaw siam teh se, puithiam hna thawk tûra serh hran a ni dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hêng thawmhnawte hi an siam tûr a ni: âwmbel te, efod te, kawrfual te, kawrhnuai te, diar ṭial te, kâwnghrên te, i u Arona leh a fapate hâk atân puithiam kawr te hi siam sela, ka puithiamah an ṭang dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Rangkachak te, la dumpâwl te, senduk te, senlâr leh la zai sîn te an hmang tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Efod chu themthiam rual chuan rangkachak zai te, la zai sîn te, a dumpâwl te, a senlâr te, a senduk tein tah rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Darbak pahnih, a hnung lam leh hma lama invuah, bah luh tlatna tûr siam sela.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kâwnghrên rangkachak zai sîn te, la zai sîn thlûr, a dumpâwl te, a senduk te, a senlârtea inchawih mawi taka tah tûr a ni. Kâwnga hrên behna tûr Efod kawr hmâwrah chuan efod puan ang chiaha zeh mawi tah zawm tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Soham lungmantam pahnih la la, Israela thlah hnam sâwm leh pahnih hming ker ang che;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />an upat dân indawtin an hming chu ker ang che, pakhatah paruk ve vein.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mi themthiam kertîr la, rangkachakah phûm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lungmantam pahnih chu dârbakah chuan Israel hnam sâwm leh pahnih hriat reng nân bel ang che; Arona chuan Lalpa hmaah an hming chu dârbakah chuan a bât tel ang a, Israel hnamte chu ka hre chhuak ṭhîn dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lungmantam phûmna tûr rangkachak pahnih chher la;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />rangkachak hlîr hlak khaidiat inherh siam bawk la, chûng phûmnaah chuan vuah ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“La zai sîn thlûr, a dumpâwl te, a senduk te, a senlâr te leh rangkachak zai tea efod anga tah, Pathian râwn huna puithiam âwma bel tûr mi themthiamte chu inchawih mawi takin tahtîr ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thlep la, thleh hnuah chuan kil li nei, khâp bial ni rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lungmantam tlar li-a phûmna tûr siam la, tlar khatah chuan Odam lung te, Pitda lung te, Bareket lung te awm sela;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />tlar hnihnaah Nopek te, Safir te, Jahalom te awm sela,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />tlar thumnaah Lesem te, Sebo te, Ak-elama te awm sela;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />tlar linaah Tarsis te, Soham te, Jaspi te awm sela; chûng lungmantamte chu rangkachak phêka phûm ṭhêt tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lungmantam pakhatah hian Israel hnam sâwm leh pahnih hming pakhat zêl ker tûr a ni, nemna zungbun anga ker tûr a ni; chung lungmantam sâwm leh pahnih chuan Israel hnam sâwm leh pahnih a entîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Âwmbel khai nân rangkachak hlîr hlak khaidiat herh siam la,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />rangkachak beng pahnih, âwmbel tlânga vuah tûr siam bawk ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Khaidiat herh hmâwr hnih chu âwmbel tlânga bengah chuan vuah tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A hmâwr lehlam pahnih chu, lungmantam pahnih phûmnaah khân tibet la, efod dârbak nên inzawm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Efod dep, âwmbel chhûng tlângah chuan rangkachak beng pahnih bel bawk ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Efod dârbak vuahna zâwn, efod hrên behna mawi taka tah tlângah rangkachak beng dang pahnih bel bawk ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Âwmbel leh efod-a rangkachak beng chu la dumpâwl hrualin suih zawm ang che; âwmbel chu kâwng zâwnah bei tlat rawh se, a che sawn thei tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Arona chu Hmun Thianghlima a lo luhin âwmbel, Israel hnamte hming chuanna chu, a rawn bel tûr a ni; chu chu, kei Lalpa hian, ka mite ka hriat chhuah theihna tûr a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“Efod kawrah chuan Urim leh Thumim chu dah la, kei Lalpa hi, mi râwn tûra a lo kal apiangin, Arona thinlung zâwnah chuan a awm ṭhîn dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chutianga Arona a lo kal apiangin Efod chu a ha ṭhîn ang a, mipuite thu zawh chu a chhâng ṭhîn ang. “Efod hnuaia hâk tûr kawrfual chu la dumpâwl veka tah tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A laiah lu rawlhna tûr rek pawp la, a reh pawh tlâng chu a thlêr loh nân a chehna tûr puan tah chuan chep ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />A kawrfual hmâwrah chuan la dumpâwl te, la senduk te leh la senlâr tea siam theibuhfai lem leh rangkachak tengeng inkârthlâk chiata vuah chhuah tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Chu chu puithiam hna a thawh hunah Arona chuan a ha ṭhîn tûr a ni. Hmun Thianghlima Lalpa hmaa a luhin emaw, a chhuahin emaw tengeng chu a ri ṭhîn ang a, a thi lo tih a hriat dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />“Rangkachak hlîr hlak phêkah nemna zungbun ker angin, ‘ Lalpa pual’ tih ker ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Puithiam diar hma lamah bel la, la dumpâwl hrualin thlung bet ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Arona chuan diar chawpin a chalah a khim ṭhîn tûr a ni; tichuan, kei Lalpa hian Israel-te inthawina thil ka hnêna an rawn hlan chu ka lo pawm ang a, thil hlana tihsual an neih pawhin Arona chuan a mawh a phur ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />“Arona hâk tûr, kawr hnuai te, a khim tûr diar te, la zai sîna tah tûr a ni a; a hrên tûr kâwnghrên pawh la zai sîn tah tûr a ni, mawi taka chei tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />“Kawrfual te, kâwnghrên te, lukhum te, Arona fate tân siamsak bawk rawh, tiropuia timawitu ni rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />I u Arona leh a fapate chu hâktîr la, ka rawngbâwl tûra puithiam atân oliv hriak thih la, hlân la, serh hrang ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />La zai sîna tah, kekawr hnuai siamsak bawk ang che, malpui thlenga fual ni rawh se, chutilo chu an lang palh ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Arona leh a fate chuan, Biakbûka an lo luhin emaw, Hmun Thianghlima awm maichâma puithiam hna thawk tûra an lo kalin emaw chûng chu an ha ziah tûr a ni; an lan palh chuan an thi mai ang. Hei hi Arona leh a thlahte tân kumkhaw tih dâna hman tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Ka rawng bâwla puithiam hna thawk tûr chu hetiang hian serh hran tûr a ni; bâwngtuai pakhat leh berâmchal pahnih, hmêlhem lo kai la,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />dawidim telh loh chhang te, hriaka hmeh chhangpêr te, hriaka tâl chhang pan te, chhangphut ṭha chiin siam ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chûng chu fawngah dah la, bâwng leh berâm hlan hunah i hlân tel dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Arona leh a fate chu Biakbûk kawngka bulah awm sela, dân angin tuiah insiltîr ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Puithiam silhfên chu la la, kawrfual te, efod kawr te, efod hnuai kawrfual te, âwmbel te, kâwnghrên te chuan Arona chu inthuam rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />‘ Lalpa pual’ tih belna diar chu khimtîr bawk ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thih atân bîka siam oliv hriak chu la la, a lu-ah leihin thih ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Arona fapate pawh lo kal sela, kawr hâktîr la,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />kâwnghrên hrêngin lukhumte chu khum sela, puithiamah chutiang chuan nemnghet la, puithiam an ni kumkhua tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Bâwngtuai chu Biakbûk hmaah rawn kai ula, Arona leh a fate chuan bâwng lu-ah chuan an kut nghat sela.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Biakbûk kawngka bul Lalpa hmaah talh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bâwng thisen chu la la, kutzungṭangin maichâm kil ki-ah chuan tât ang che; tah bâng chu maichâm bulah leihbua ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A rîlbawh thau te, a kal te leh a bawhtu thau te, a thin hlâwm ṭha laite la la, sual thawina atân maichâmah hâl ral rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A sa te, a vun te, a kawchhûng te erawh chu daipâwnah hâl ral ang che, sual thawina thilhlan a ni a, hâl ral vek tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Berâmchal pakhat chu kai la, Arona leh a fate chuan a lu-ah an kut nghat rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Talh la, a thisen chuan maichâm chu theh kual ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A sa chu chan sawm la; a kawchhûng leh a kete chu sil fai la, a lu nên dah khâwm ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A zavai chuan maichâmah hâl la, Lalpa tâna hâlral thilhlan a ni, a rim chu Lalpa rimtui tih zâwng tak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Berâm pakhat pawh chu kai la, Arona leh a fate chuan a lu-ah an kut nghat rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Talh la, a thisen chu Arona leh a fate beng ding lam tengengah te, kut ding lam zungpui hmâwrah te, kezungpui ding lam hmâwrah te tât la, maichâmah pawh theh kual ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Maichâma thisen te, oliv hriak thih chi te chu a ṭhen la la, Arona chu a kawrah nên theh ang che; a fate pawh an kawrah nên theh ang che; tichuan, Arona leh a fate chu an thawmhnaw nên ka tâna serh hran an ni tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Berâm mei thau tak chu hlep la, a rîlbawh thau te, a thin hlâwm ṭha lai leh a kal pahnih leh a thau bawhtu leh a bawp ding lam chu la la,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />chhang hlan, fawnga dah, chi khat zêl, dawidim telh loh chhang te, hriak nêna hmeh chhangpêr te, hriaka tâl chhang pan te pakhat ṭheuh la la,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />chûng chu Arona leh a fate chu pe la, Lalpa hmaah thêntîr rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />I lâksak leh ang a, maichâma hâlral thilhlan chungah dah la, Lalpa tân hâl ral ang che; Lalpa rimtui tih zâwng tak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Berâm irno chu la la, Lalpa hmaah thênin hlân ang che; chu chu i chanpual ve tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Puithiam ruat nghehna berâm irno leh a bawp hi thênin ka hnênah hlân ula, puithiamte chanpual ve tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Israel faten remna thilhlan an hlanin a irno leh a bawp chu puithiamho chan kumkhua atân ka ruat tlat a ni; hei hi mipui thilpêk ka dawn ve chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Arona puithiam thuam serh hi a faten an chhawm zêl tûr a ni, puithiam hna thawk tûra serh hrannaah an ha ve zêl tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Arona fa, a aiawha puithiama ruat chuan rawngbâwl tûra Hmun Thianghlima a lo kal hunah ni sarih chhûng a ha tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Puithiam ruat nghehnaa berâmpa in hman sa chu Hmun Thianghlimah chhûm ang che,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Arona leh a fate chuan Biakbûk kawngka bulah, fawnga chhang hlan nên a sa chu ei rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Anmahni ruat nghehnaa sual thawina sa chu anmahni chauhvin an ei tûr a ni; thil thianghlim a ni a, puithiam chauh ei tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />A sa leh chhang chu ei sên loh a awm chuan zîngah hâl tûr a ni, sa serh a ni a, a ṭhing chu ei tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Thu ka pêk che ang chuan Arona leh a fate chu ni sarih chhûng i tihrang tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ni tin, sual thawi nân bâwngchal hlân ang che; sual thawina chu hlânin maichâm chu i thian ang a, oliv hriak i hnawih ang a, i tithianghlim tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Chutiang chuan ni sarih chhûng, ni tin ti ang che; tichuan, maichâm chu a lo thianghlim kim vek ang a, mi narânin an khawih chuan an tuar ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />“Maichâmah chuan ni tin berâm kum khat vêla upa i hlân ziah tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Zîngah pakhat i hlân ang a, tlaiah pawh a dang pakhat i hlân dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Berâm pakhat rual chuan chhangphut ṭha chi kg. khat leh oliv hriak thlit fîm litar khat i hlân tûr a ni; thilhlan ruala uain leihbuak tûr litar khat hlân tel bawk ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tlai lama berâm pakhat hlan rual pawh chuan chhangphut ṭha chi te, oliv te, uain te hlân tel ang che. Hei hi ei tûr thilhlan, kei Lalpa hnêna hlan chu a ni, a hâl rim chu a tui a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Lalpa Biakbûk kawngkaa hâlral thilhlan chu in hlân kumkhua tûr a ni; chutah chuan ka mite ka rawn hmu ang a, thu ka hrilh ṭhîn ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Chutah chuan Israel fate chu ka be ṭhîn ang a, ka ropuina chu a châm reng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Biakbûk leh maichâm chu ka tithianghlim ang a, ka rawngbâwltu atân Arona leh a fate chu ka tihrang ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Israel mite zîngah chuan ka chêng ve ang a, an Pathian ka ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />An zînga ka tel ve ṭhin nân Aigupta ram ata ka hruai chhuak a, kha Pathian, Lalpa kha ka ni tih an hria ang; Lalpa , an Pathian ka nih hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Sitim thingin rimtui hâlna tûr maichâm siam ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kil li nei, tawng khat bial, a sân lam tawng hnih ni sela, kil tinah a ki lawr awm sela, inzawm vek rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A chung zâwl te, a sîr te, a kîte chu rangkachak hlîr hlakin luan tûr a ni, a tlâng chu rangkachaka luan tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A zâwnfung vuahna tûr rangkachak beng pali siam la, a sîr lehlam lehlamah, a tlâng bulah vuah ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A zâwnfung chu sitim thing ni sela, rangkachaka luan tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Rimtui hâlna maichâm chu Thuthlung Bâwm dahna puanzâr pindan pâwnah hûng ang che. Thuthlung Bâwm chhîn chu ka rawn biak ṭhinna tûr che a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tûk tin, Aronan khâwnvâr a rawn tihfai pahin thil rimtui a hâl ṭhîn tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tlaiah pawh, khâwnvâr a rawn chhit dâwnin rimtui chu a hâl ziah tûr a ni. Lalpa hnêna rimtui hâl hi kumkhuaa chhunzawm zêl tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Maichâmah hian hâl khap thil rimtui te, hâlral thilhlan te, chhang hlante i hâl tûr a ni lo, in tûr uain hlan pawh i leihbaw tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kum tin, vawi khat, sual thawina thilhlan thisen chu, Arona chuan, maichâm then thianghlim nân a ki-ah a hnawih tûr a ni; kumkhuain hei hi kum tin vawi khat tih ziah tûr a ni; maichâm chu Lalpa tân a thianghlim reng tûr a ni.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Mosia hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Chhiarpui laia hri-a mi an thih loh nân Israel mite i chhiar huna tel zawng chuan nun tlanna an pe tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chhiarpuia tel zawng zawngin pêk tûr tuk zât chu an pe tûr a ni, Inbiakna bûka hman lai bûkna dik taka bûk sekel chanve, Gera sâwm an pe tûr a ni; chu chu LALPA hnêna thilhlan a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chhiarpuia chhiar tel, kum sawmhnih leh a chung lam zawng zawng chuan Lalpa hnênah hei hi an hlân tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />An nun tlanna Lalpa hnêna an hlan hun chuan sekel chanve mi tinin an hlân ṭheuh tûr a ni; mi hausain a aia tam an hlân tûr a ni lo, mi rethei pawhin chu aia tlêm chu an hlân tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Israel mite hnên aṭangin he nun tlanna hi i khawn ang a, Biakbûk enkawl nân i hmang dâwn nia. He nun tlanna hi Lalpa tân Israel fate a hriat reng vena tûr a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Mosia hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Insilna tui dah nân dâr chawhtawlh, a hûnna dâr nên siam ang che; hâlral hâlna maichâm leh Biakbûk inkârah hûng la, tui dah reng ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Arona leh a fate chuan an kut leh an ke hetah hian an sil ṭhîn tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Biakbûk chhûnga an kal dâwnin emaw, thilhlan hâl tûra an kal hunah emaw an insil tûr a ni; tichuan, an thi lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />An thih loh nân an kut leh ke an sil ngei tûr a ni. Hei hi an thlahte pawhin kumkhaw dânah an neih ve zêl tûr a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lalpan Mosia hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Thil rimtui tak tak, Mura tui kg. ruk, thakthîng rimtui kg. thum, Saitronela rimtui kg. thum,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tez-pata kg. ruk, Inbiakna bûka hman lai bûklunga bûk vek la khâwm la, oliv hriak litar li nên chawhpawlh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Têl rimtui anga siam rimtui chawhpawlh chu hriak thianghlim hnawih atân hmang ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Biakbûk te, Thuthlung Bâwm te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />dawhkân leh a hmanrua te, rimtui hâlna maichâm te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />thilhlan hâlna maichâm leh a hmanrua te, insilna dâr chawhtawlh te leh a hûnna te hnawihah chu chu hmang ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Chu hriak chu chutianga hnawihin hêngte hi tithianghlim la, an lo thianghlim vek ang a, a khawih apiangin an tuar ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ka rawngbâwl tûrin Arona leh a fate chu he hriak hi thih la, tihrang ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Israel fate chu hrilh rawh; he hriak thianghlim hi ka rawngbâwltu tûr serh hran huna thih atân hman kumkhua tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Mi narân thih tûr a ni lo; thil chi hrang hrang chawhpawlh tûr zât hi tihdanglam tûr a ni hek lo; thil thianghlim a ni a, in serh hle tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hetianga thih tûr hriak leh thil dang chawhpawlh lo siam vete emaw, puithiam tûr ni lo thihtu emaw chu Israel mite zîng ata tuithlâr tûr a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Mosia hnênah, “Hêng thil rimtui Netep te, Sekelet te, Kalbana te, Beraw fîmte inzât chiah zêlin la la,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />rimtuia hâl atân tel rimtui chawhpawlh angin chawhpawlh ang che, vêng hima tithianghlim tûrin chi tlêm telh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />A ṭhen chu râwt dip derh la, Biakbûkah, ka biak ṭhinna tûr che Thuthlung Bâwm bulah theh darh ang che; chu chu thil thianghlim berah neih tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Nangma hman tûrin chutiang taka rimtui chawhpawlh chu i siam tûr a ni lo; thil thianghlim, Lalpa tâna serh hran a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Mahni hâl tûr chutianga rimtui chawhpawlh siam vetu rêng rêng chu a miten an tuithlâr tûr a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Mosia hnênah, “Uria fapa, Bezalela, Hura tupa, Juda hnam zînga mi chu ka thlang chhuak ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Finna te, hriatna te, hmangchâng hriatna te, thil engkim siam tûra
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />kut themthiamna te nei tûrin Pathian Thlarau ka pe ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thil mawi tûr ngaihtuah chhuaka, rangkachak te, tangkarua te leh dâr tea siam nghâl thiamna te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />lungmantam kera phûm te, thing ker te, thil mawi chi tinrêng siam thiamna te ka pe a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amah pui tûrin Dan hnama mi Ahisamaka fapa Oholiaba pawh ka thlang tawh a ni. Themthiam rual dang pawh, siam tûra ka tih zawng zawng siam thiamna ka pe a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Biakbûk an sa ang a, Thuthlung Bâwm leh a chhîn te, Biakbûk thuahna te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />dawhkân leh a hmanrua te, rangkachak hlîr hlaka siam khâwnvâr bâwr leh a hmanrua te, rimtui hâlna maichâm te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />thilhlan hâlna maichâm leh a hmanrua te, insilna tûr chawhtawlh leh a hûnna te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Arona leh a fate puithiam hna thawka ka rawng an bâwl huna an inthuamna tûr thuam ropui te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />puithiam nemngheha thih tûr hriak te, Hmun Thianghlima rimtui hâl tûr te an siam dâwn nia. Ka sawi ang thlap khân hêng hi an siam tûr a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Mosia hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Israel fate chu hrilh rawh: Ka sabat ni hi an serh tûr a ni; in thlah zêlte thlengin kei Lalpa hi, nangmahni thlang chhuaktu che u ka nih in hriat rengna tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sabat hi in tân ni thianghlim a ni ang; in serh tûr a ni a, a bawhchhia chu tihhlum tûr a ni; hna thawk lui pawh chu in zîng ata tihboral tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ni ruk chhûng hna thawhna hun in nei a, a ni sarihna chu Lalpa tân ni serh a ni a, in châwl tûr a ni; sabat nia hna thawk chu tihhlum ngei tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chuvângin, Israel fate chuan, kan inkâra thuthlung an hriat reng nân kumkhuain an serh tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kei leh Israel fate, kan inkâra thuthlung chhinchhiahna a ni ang; kei Lalpa hian ni ruk chhûngin lei leh vân ka siam zo va, a ni sarih ni chuan hna ka bânsan a, ka châwl a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pathianin Sinai tlânga Mosia a biak zawh chuan, a thupêk, amah Pathian ngeiin lungphêka a ziak chu Mosia hnênah chuan a pe a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mosia chu tlâng aṭanga a lo chhuk tâk lawk loh avângin Arona hnênah mite chu an kal khâwm a, “Khai, min hruaitu tûr Pathian min siamsak teh; Aigupta ram aṭanga min hruai chhuaktupa Mosia lah hi a chanchin eng mah kan hre tawh si lo,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Arona chuan, “In nupui te, in fapa te, leh in fanute rangkachak bengbeh thlawnsak ula, han la ta che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi zawng zawng chuan an rangkachak bengbehte chu an thlawn a, Arona an pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ani chuan a lo dawng a, rangkachak chu a rawh tui a, a chhûnna tûr a siamah chuan bâwngno, a pa lim a chhûng ta a. Mite chuan, “Aw Israel-te u, hei hi Aigupta ram aṭanga hruai chhuaktu che u pathian chu a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chu chu Aronan a hriat chuan bâwngno lim hmaah chuan maichâm a siam a; “Naktûkah Lalpa chawimawina ruai kan ṭheh ang,” tiin a tlângautîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A tûk zîngah chuan hâlral thilhlan an hlân a, remna thilhlan an rawn la bawk a, an hlân a, mipuite chu ruai kîl tûr chuan an ṭhu a, inphalrai ruai a ni ta ngawt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Mosia hnênah, “Chhuk thuai teh, Aigupta ram aṭanga i hruai chhuah, i mite khu an khawlo zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />An awm dân tûr ka hrilh ang khân an awm rei peih ta hauh lo mai; rangkachak bâwngno lim an chhûng a, chibai an bûk a, inthawina an hlân e, ‘Aw Israel-te u, hei hi Aigupta ram aṭanga hruai chhuaktu che u in pathian chu a ni, an ti,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Mosia hnênah, “Hêng mite hi an luhlul hle mai ka ti!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka thinur êm mai, khawi nge, ka zu tihlum vek teh ang, nang chauh hi hnam ropui takah ka han din teh ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mosia chuan a Pathian, Lalpa chu a ngên a, “Aw Lalpa , ropui tak leh kut chak tak hmanga Aigupta ram ata i hruai chhuah i mite chungah engtizia nge chuti taka i thinur le!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />‘Tlângrama tihhluma, tihchimih tumin a mite chu Aigupta ram ata a hruai chhuak a lo nih hi,’ Aigupta mite chuan an ti dâwn asin. Thinur tawh teh suh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />I chhiahhlawh Abrahama te, Isaka te, Israela te kha hre reng teh; mahni inchhâlin an hnênah, ‘Arsi zâtin in thlahte ka tipung ang a, ka sawi ram zawng zawng hi in thlahte hnênah ka pe ang a, an nei kumkhua ang,’ tiin i tiam kha,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tichuan, Lalpa chuan a mite chunga thil ṭha lo tih a tum chu a ṭhulh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mosia chu tlâng aṭang chuan a chhuk thla a, a kut lehlam lehlam chuan thupêk ziakna lungphêk chu a keng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lungphêkte chu Pathian siam a ni; a ziak pawh chu Pathian ngeiin kerin a ziak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mipui au thâwm chu Josua chuan a han hria a, “Chu! riahhmuna thâwm chu indo thâwm a va ni âwm ve?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mosia chuan, “Hnehtu au thâwm a ni lo va, chan chau thâwm lah a ni hek lo, hlimhlawp zai thâwm a nih chu,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, riahhmun chu a zu thleng hnai a, Mosia chuan bâwngno lim leh mipui lâm huai huai chu a han hmu a, a thin a ur ta êm êm a. Tlâng bulṭhutah chuan a lungphêk ken chu a vawm keh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Bâwngno lim an chhûn chu a la lawk a, a rawh a, a râwt dip a, tuiah a phul a, Israel fate chu a intîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Arona hnênah, “Engtin nge mipuiin an tih che a heti taka thil sual i tihtîr tâk le?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Arona chuan a chhâng a, “Ka Lalpa thinur chu ka chungah alh teh suh se, hêng mite hian thil sual tih an châk zek zekzia i hria alâwm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />‘Min hruaitu tûr pathian min siamsak rawh, Aigupta ram aṭanga min hruai chhuaktu Mosia lah hi a chanchin pawh kan hre tawh si lo,’ an rawn ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Keiin an hnênah, ‘Rangkachak nei chuan thlawn sela, rawn dah rawh se,’ ka lo ti a. An rawn dah a, keiin ka rawh a, bâwngno limah a chang ta mai alâwm maw le!” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mipui chu an duh duhin an tâl a, an hmêlmate hmuhsit hial khawpin Arona chuan a lo tâltîr mai mai a ni tih Mosian a hmuh chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />riahhmun lamah a va ding a, “ Lalpa lama ṭang duh chu ka hnênah hian lo kal rawh se,” a ti a. Levia thlah zawng zawng chu a lamah chuan an kal ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />An hnênah, “Israel-te Pathian, Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: ‘mipa chuan khandaih pai ula, riahhmun luhnaah lûtin bûkte chu fang chhuak ula, mahni unau pawh, ṭhian pawh, ṭhenawmpa pawh that rawh se,’ a ti,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Levia thlahte chuan Mosia sawi ang chuan an ti a; chumi ni chuan mi sângthum lai an that a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mosia chuan, “Mahni fate leh unaute bei hial khawpin Lalpa tân in inpe a, mal a sâwm ngei ang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A tûkah chuan Mosian mipui hnênah, “Thil sual râpthlâk tak in ti a; mahse, tûnah hian Lalpa hnênah ka han chho leh tâng e, in sual a lo ngaidam thei mial mahna,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Mosia chu Lalpa hnênah a kal chho leh a, “Hêng mite hian thil sual râpthlâk tak an ti a, rangkachak pathian an siam tâk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Mahse, an sual hi i ngaidam thei hrâm ang emaw chu? I theih lul loh chuan i mite hming ziakna bu ata ka hming kha thai bo mai ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Mosia chu a chhâng a, “Ka lehkhabu aṭangin ka chunga thil tisualtu hming chauh a ni ka thai bo dâwn ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Kal ta la, ka hrilh tawh che hmunah he mite hi hruai rawh. Ngai teh, ka Vântirhkoh chuan i hma a hruai zêl ang a; ka rawn tlawh hunah chuan an sualna ngei chauhvah a ni ka rawn hrem dâwn ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tichuan, rangkachak bâwngno lim Arona an siamtîr avâng chuan Lalpa chuan mipui zîngah hri a lêntîr ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Mosia hnênah, “Aigupta ram aṭanga i mi hruai chhuahte hi chhuahpui la, Abrahama te, Isaka te, Jakoba te hnêna pêk ka tiam ramah chuan kal rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka Vântirhkoh chuan in hma a hruai ang a, Kanan mi te, Amor mi te, Hit mi te, Periz mi te, Hiv mi te leh Jebus mi te chu ka ûm chhuak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chu ram, khawizu leh hnutetuia luang ramah chuan kal ula, kei erawh chu ka lo kal ve lo vang, in luhlul êm a, kawng lakah ka tichimit hlauh dah ang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Miten chu thu ṭha lo tak chu an hriat chuan an lungngai ta êm êm a, an inchei duh ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Mosia hnênah, “Mi luhlul tak in ni, in zînga ka kal ve zawngin ka tichimit mai ang che u. In chunga ka tih dân tûr ka han ngaihtuah ang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sinai tlâng an chhuahsan hnu chuan Israel fate chuan incheimawina an inbel tawh ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel-ten bûk an khuarna apiangah Mosia chuan Biakbûk chu bûk pâwn deuhvah a zâr ṭhîn a, Inbiakna bûk, a vuah a. Tu pawhin Lalpa an râwn duh chuan bûk pâwna Inbiakna bûkah chuan an pan ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Inbiakna bûkah Mosia a kal dâwn chuan mi tin mahni puan in kawngkaah chuan an lo chhuak a, Inbiakna bûk a luh hma chu dingin Mosia chu an enzui ṭhap ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Inbiakna bûka Mosia a luh vêleh chhûm ding kha a lo chhuk a, Inbiakna bûk kawngkaah chuan Mosia hnênah Lalpa chuan thu a sawi ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Inbiakna bûk kawngkhâra chhûm ding an hmuh chuan mi zawng zawng chu an puan in kawngkaah chuan an kûn a, chibai an bûk ṭheuh ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Miin a ṭhian a bia ang hian Lalpa chuan Mosia chu inhmachhawn meuhvin a be ṭhîn. Mosia chu bûkah a lo kîr ṭhîn a; amaherawhchu, amah puitu Nuna fapa tlangvâl Josua erawh chuan Inbiakna bûk chu a chhuahsan ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mosia chuan Lalpa hnênah, “Hêng mite hi hruai chhuak tûrin min ti a, tu nge min kalpui dâwn tih min la hrilh si lo. Min hria a, min duhsak a ni tih min hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khai le, min duhsak takmeuh a nih chuan i thiltum chu min hrilh teh; tichuan, i mit tlungin i rawng ka bâwl thei ang a, he mite hi i mi thlante chu an lo ni ngei tih ka hre thei bawk dâwn nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ani chuan a chhâng a, “In zîngah ka tel ve zêl ang a, ka chhâwk zâng zêl ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mosia chuan, “Min kalpui ve zêl dâwn si loh phei chuan he hmun ata hi kan kal sawn lo mai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kan zînga i tel ve zêl si loh chuan i mite leh ka chungah hian i lungawi a ni tih tu nge hria ang? I tel ve erawh chuan khawvêla mi tinin mi danglam bîk tak kan ni tih an hria ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Mosia hnênah, “Ka hre chiang che a, mi tihlâwm hle avângin i ngen ang chuan ka ti ang e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mosia chuan, “Khawngaih takin i hmêl chu min hmuhtîr ta che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ani chuan, “I hnênah ka ṭhatzia ka tilang ang a, ka hming pawh i hriatah ka sawi ang, Lalpa ka nih hi. Ka duh apiang chungah ngil ka nei ang a, ka duh apiang chu ka khawngaih mai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka hmêl erawh chu i hmu thei lo vang; min hmu chu tu mah an nung thei lo a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lalpa chuan a sawi zêl a, “En teh, ka bulah hian din theihna lungpui a awm a, lo ding la,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />ropui taka ka lo kal hunah lungpui kehkârah hian ka dah ang chia, ka kal pelh hma che chu ka kutin ka hliah ang chia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />ka liam dâwn hunah ka kut chu ka la sawn ang a, ka hnung lam chu i hmu thei ang, ka hmêl chu i hmu thei lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Mosia hnênah, ‘I tihkeh tâk lungphêk pahnih ang kha chher la, a hmaa ka thu ziak ang kha ka lo ziak leh ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Naktûk zîngah insiam la, Sinai tlângah rawn chhohpui la, ka hmaah rawn inlan rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tu mah an lo kal ve tûr a ni lo; tlângah tu mah awm suh se, berâm rual leh bâwng rual pawh tlâng pangah tla suh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tichuan, a hmaa mi ang lungphêk pahnih Mosia chuan a chher a. Zîng takah a tho va, Lalpa thupêk ang chuan Sinai tlângah lungphêk chu a keng chho ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chhûmah chuan Lalpa chu a lo chhuk a, a bulah a lo ding a, a hming Lalpa chu a ni tih a rawn puang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalpa chu a hmaah a lo kal a, “Kei hi Lalpa chu ka ni, Pathian rinawm, khawngaih thei leh ngilnei, thinnel leh lainatna ngah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />chhuan sâng thleng pawha khawngaih zui zêltu; khawlohna te, bawhchhiatna te, sualnate ngaidama, thiam loh changte erawh chu zuah lova, an pate khawlohna avânga an fate leh an tute, chhuan thum chhuan li thlêng pawha hrem ṭhîntu Pathian ka ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mosia chu rang zetin lei siin a kûn a, Lalpa chu chibai a bûk ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Heti hian a ti a, “Aw Lalpa , ka chungah i lâwm takzet a nih chuan Lalpa chu kan zîngah kal ve ngei teh se, hêng mite hi an luhlul hle na a, kan khawlohna leh kan sualna ngaidam la, i pual, i rochanah min nei ang che,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Mosia hnênah, “Israel fate tân thu ka thlung e. Khawvêla tu hnam zîng maha la tih ngai loh an hmaah thil mak ka ti dâwn. In awmnaa mi zawng zawngin kei Lalpa hian thil ka tihtheihzia an hmu ang, thil mak elkhên ka tihsak dâwn che u a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Vawiina ka thupêk che u hi zâwm tlat zêl ang che u; ngai teh u, in hmaah Amor mi te, Kanan mi te, Hit mi te, Periz mi te, Hiv mi te leh Jebus mi te ka ûm chhuak dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Fîmkhur rawh u, in kalna tûr ram mite nên thu in thlung vaih ang e, in inâwk buai mai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />An maichâm chu paih darh ula, an lung serh phunte chu vaw sawm ula, an pathiannu lim Aseri te chu kit vek ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pathian dang hmaah in kûn tûr a ni lo, Lalpa hi thîkthuchhia, Pathian thîkthuchhe tak a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chu rama awmte nên thu in thlun hlauh chuan, an pathian chibai bûka an inthawina hmunah a sa ei tûrin an sâwm ang che u a, an pathian hnêna an thil hlan chu ei ve in châk mai dah ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />In fate nupuiah an fanute in neihsak ang a, anni chuan ka hnên aṭangin an hruai bo ang a, an pathiante chu in fate chuan an be ve dah ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“I tân milem chhûn chawp pathian insiam suh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Dawidim telh loh kût hmang ṭhîn rawh. Abib thla, ka hun ruatah, thu ka pêk che u angin ni sarih chhûng dawidim telh loh chhang in ei ṭhîn tûr a ni; Abib thla hi Aigupta ram in chhuahsan thla kha a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Piang hmasa ber a pa tawh phawt chu ka ta a ni. I ran vulh, bâwng leh berâm no neih hmasak ber, a pa chu, min pe tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sabengtung no hrin hmasak ber, a pa chu, berâm novin i tlan tûr a ni; i tlan duh loh chuan a ring elh tliah tûr a ni. In fa tîr, mipa chu, in tlan zêl tûr a ni. Tu mah kut ruakin ka hnênah in lo kal tûr a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Ni ruk chhûng hna in thawk ang a, a ni sarih ni chuan in thawk tûr a ni lo, leileh lai leh buh seng lai pawhin in châwl tho tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Huit seng tirhah Pentikos kût hmang ang che u, in theirahte in lawh fai vek hnu, favângah Bâwkte kût hmang ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“ Lalpa Israel-te Pathian hmaah in zînga mipa zawng zawng chu kum khatah vawi thum an lo lang ziah tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“In hmaa hnam dangte ka ûm chhuaha, in ramrite ka tihzauh hunah chuan in Pathian Lalpa chibai bûka ṭum thum in kal chhûng hian tu man in ram chu rawn lâk an tum lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Thilhlan in rawn hlanin dawidim telh chhang rawn hlân tel suh u. Kalhlên kût sa, a tûk atân a ṭhing pakhat mah dah suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“I lova thlai thar hmasa ber chu Lalpa , i Pathian inah han dah ang che. Kêl no chu a pui hnutein chhûm suh.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Mosia hnênah, “Hêng thu hi ziak chhuak rawh, hêng tlawhchhan hian a ni nang leh Israel-te hnêna thu ka thlun ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Mosia chu ni sawmli leh zân sawmli eng mah ei lovin Lalpa bulah chuan a awm a, Lungphêkah chuan thuthlung, thupêk sâwm chu a ziak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Thupêk sâwm ziakna lungphêk keng chuan Mosia chu Sinai tlâng aṭang chuan a lo chhuk a; a hmêl chu a êng sût a, Lalpa nên an inbiak avânga êng a ni, ani erawh chuan chu chu a hre lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Arona leh Israel mipui chuan Mosia hmêl êng an hmuh chuan a bulah an kal hnai ngam ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Mosia chuan a au va, Arona leh Israel hotute chu an lo kîr a, Mosia chuan thu a lo hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Chumi hnu chuan Israel fate chu an vaiin Mosia bulah chuan an lo kal a, Sinai tlânga Lalpa thupêk zawng zawng chu a lo hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Mosian thu a sawi zawh chuan khuhnain a hmai chu a khuh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Lalpa nêna inbe tûra Inbiakna bûka a kal apiangin, a lo chhuah leh hma chu, hmai khuhna chu a hlîp ṭhîn; a lo chhuahin Israel fate hnêna hrilh tûr thupêk chu a hrilh ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Israel faten Mosia hmêl an hmuhin a lo êng ta ṭhîn a, Pathian nêna inbe tûra a kal leh hma chu a inkhuh ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mosia chuan Israel fa pungkhâwmho chu a ko khâwm a, an hnênah, “Hêng hi in tih tûra Lalpa thupêk chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ni ruk chhûng hna in thawk ang a, a ni sarih ni erawh chu in tân ni serh a ni ang a, Lalpa chawimawi nân urhsûn taka hman tûr a ni; hna thawk lui chu tihhlum tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />In awmna apiangah sabat ni chuan mei pawh in chhêm tûr a ni lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mosia chuan Israel fa pungkhâwmho hnênah, “ Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa tân thilpêk han pe rawh u, mahni phal ang ang han pe rawh u; rangkachak te, tangkarua te, dâr te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />la dumpâwl te, la senduk te, la senlâr te, la zai sîn te, kêl hmul te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />berâm vun tihsen te, savun ṭha chi te, sitim thing te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />khâwnvâra chhit tûr oliv hriak te, thih tûr hriak te, hâl tûr thil rimtui te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />soham lung te leh âwmbela dah tûr lungmantam te rawn dah khâwm rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“In zînga mi themthiam rual lo thawk sela, Lalpa sawi angin hêng zawng zawng hi rawn siam rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Biakbûk, a chung khuhna leh a thuahna te, a inbahna te, a bang tun te, a kaihna te, a ban te, a bulṭhut te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thuthlung Bâwm leh a zâwnfung te, bâwm chhîn leh a zâr hliahna tûr puan te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />dawhkân leh a zâwnfung te, a hmanrua zawng zawng leh chhang serh te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />khâwnvâr bâwr chhit ên tûr leh a bungrua te, a chhitna tûr lu bâwk leh a tui tûr hriak te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />rimtui hâlna dawhkân leh a zâwnfung te; hriak thih tûr te, hâl tûr thil rimtui te, Biakbûk luhna kawngka puanzâr tûr te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />thilhlan hâlna tûr maichâm, a sîra dâr tlâwn nên, zâwnfung leh a bungrua zawng zawng te, dâr chawhtawlh leh a hûnna te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />a hungna puanzâr tûr, a ban leh a bulṭhut te, a tual kawngka luhnaa zâr tûr puan te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Biakbûk khen nghehna leh hungna pal khen nghehna leh a pawhna hrui te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hmun Thianghlima rawngbâwltute hâk tûr thawmhnaw zeh mawi te, puithiam Arona kawr serh te, puithiam hna an thawha Arona fate hâk tûr kawr te siam rawh se,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Israel fa pungkhâwmho chu an ṭîn darh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Biakbûk sakna tûr, a chung khuhna tûr te leh thawmhnaw thianghlim tûr te chu mahni phal ang ang Lalpa hnênah chuan an rawn hlân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pêk châkna nei chu a hmei a pain an lo kal a, hnâr vuah te, bengbeh te, pinmawi te, ṭhi te, rangkachaka siamte chu rangkachak tlangte nên Lalpa tân an rawn pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />La dumpâwl te, la senduk te, la senlâr te, la zai sîn te; kêl hmul te, berâm vun tihsen te, savun ṭha chi neite chuan an rawn pe bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tangkaruate pawh a pe thei chuan Lalpa chu an rawn pe a; Biakbûka hman tûr sitim thing nei chuan an rawn dah bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nu themthiam tak takte chuan la zai sîn te, la dumpâwl te, la senduk te, la senlâr te an kai a, an rawn pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Nu themthiam bîkten kêl hmul an thlûr chu an rawn pe bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />An hotute chuan soham lung leh lungmantam dang, efod-a dah tûr leh âwmbela târ tûr an rawn keng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Thil rimtui leh hriak, chhit atân te, thih atân te, hâl atân te an rawn thawh bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mosia hnêna Lalpan siam tûra a tih siam nân Israel zînga mi, a hmei a pa, a duh apiangin thilpêk an rawn hlân bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Mosian Israel fate hnênah, “Juda hnam zînga mi, Hura tupa Bezalela, Uria fapa chu Lalpa chuan a thlang ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Finna te, hriatna te, hmangchâng hriatna te, engkim siam tûra kut themthiamna nei tûrin Pathian Thlarauvin a pe a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Rangkachak te, tangkarua te, dâr tea thil mawi tinrêng ruahmana siam thiamna te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />phûm atân lungmantam zai mawi te, thing ker mawite leh thil chi tinrêng siam thiamna te a pe a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Dana thlaha mi, Ahisamaka fapa Oholiaba nên, an pahnihin, mi dang hnêna thil siam zirtîr thiamna pawh Lalpa chuan a pe bawk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Thil ker thiam te, thil mawi hria ten puan zai sîn, a dumpâwl te, a senduk te, a senlâr tea puan tah thiamte anga engkim tih thiamna a pe a ni. Engkim an siam thiam a, a rel vêl pawh thiam tak an ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Bezalela te, Oholiaba te leh mi themthiam rual, Lalpa chênna Biakbûk atâna thil ṭûl zawng zawng siam dân thiamna leh finna Lalpa pêkte chuan Lalpa thupêk ang chuan engkim an siam tûr a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mosia chuan Bezalela leh Oholiaba chu, thawk ve châk themthiam rual, Lalpa thilpêk hmang hriatna dawngte nên a ko khâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hmun Thianghlima rawngbâwl nâna Israel fate thilpêk an rawn dah chu Mosia hnên aṭangin an la a, an siam ta zêl a. Tûk tin, Mosia hnênah, phal takin thilpêk an rawn keng zêl bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hmun Thianghlima thil hman tûr siamin tûk tin an thawk bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mosia hnênah chuan, “Hmun Thianghlima rawngbâwl nâna Lalpan siam tûr a tih siamna atâna mamawh aia tam daih miten an rawn pe tawh a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mosian thu a pe a, riahhmunah chuan an tlângau va, “Mipa pawhin, hmeichhia pawhin, Hmun Thianghlim atân tu man thilpêk rawn pe tawh suh se,” tiin. Tichuan, Lalpa hnêna thilpêk rawn pe zêl lo tûrin mipui chu an khap ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />An pêk sa chuan an siam tûr chu a daih zân tawh a ni, hman sên rual a ni tawh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Themthiam rual zînga a thiam thiam chuan Biakbûk chu an siam ta a; chung zâr tûr puan sâwm, la zai sîn thlûr, a dumpâwl te, a senduk te, a senlâr te an tah a, cherub lemte mawi takin an zep a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Puan pakhat chu tawng sawmhnih leh pariata sei, tawng li-a hlai intiat vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Puan panga chu an ṭhui zawm a, a dang panga pawh chu a hranin an ṭhui zawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Panga ṭhui khâwm sîr ber tlângah chuan a beng atân la dumpâwl kual an vuah a; panga ṭhui khâwm dang tlângah pawh beng chu an vuah bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Beng sawmnga ve ve an vuah a, a bengte chu a inzâwn thliah a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Rangkachakin thil kawm an siam a, thil kawm chuan puan ṭhui khâwm pahnih chu an bah zawm a, a in chung chu phêk khat a ni ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Biakbûk chung thuahna tûr kêl hmul pawh sâwm leh pakhat an tah bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Puan pakhat chu tawng sawmthuma sei, tawng li-a hlai a ni; puan chu a vaiin a intiat vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Panga chu an ṭhui khâwm a; a dang paruk pawh chu a hrangin an ṭhui zawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Puan panga ṭhui khâwm sîr ber tlângah chuan beng sawmnga an siam a; paruk ṭhui khâwm tlângah pawh beng sawmnga an siam bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Dârin thil kawm sawmnga an siam a; chu chuan kêl hmul puan ṭhui khâwm pahnih chu phêk khatah an bah zawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Biakbûk chung thuah nawn lehna tûr berâm vun tihsen leh savun ṭha chi chu an siam bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A bang thuahna tûr sitim thing an rem khâwm bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />An thil rem phêk khat chu tawng sâwma sâng, tawng khat leh a chanvea hlai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A phêk tlâng kâwmna pahnih chu a hmâwr a zuih a, chu chu a bulṭhuta a inphunna tûr a ni; chutiang hmâwr zuih chu an neihtîr vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Biakbûk chhim lam bang thuahna tûrin chutiang phêk sawmhnih chu an siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A bulṭhut tûr tangkaraw tlang ker khuar sawmli an chhûng a, thing rem khâwm pakhat chu bulṭhut pahnihah a inphun a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Biakbûk hmâr lam bang thuahna tûrin phêk sawmhnih an siam bawk a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />bulṭhut tangkaraw tlang ker sawmli an chhûng bawk; phêk khat chu bulṭhut pahnihah a inphun zêl a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Biakbûk kawmchâr, khawthlang lamah bang thuahna tûr phêk ruk an rem bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A kila ṭang tûr phêk hnih an siam bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A kila ṭang tûra siamte chu a bul aṭanga a lêr thlengin an kilh zawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tichuan, kawmchâr bang thuahna tûr chu phêk riat a ni a, a bulṭhut tûr tangkaraw tlang sâwm leh paruk kerah chuan a sîr zuihte kha a inphun thliah a ni, phêk khat chuan bulṭhut pahnih a nei zêl a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A bangrel tûr sitim thing tlâwn panga zêl, hmâr lamah te, kawmchâr lamah te chuan an dah a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />a bangrel laita ber chu biakbûk bang tluan chuan an inzawmtîr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />A bang thuahna thing rem khâwmte chu rangkachak tuiin an luan a, a bangrel rawlhna tûr rangkachak beng te an siam bawk a, a bangrel pawh rangkachaka luan a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />La dumpâwl te, la senduk te, la senlâr te, la zai sîn thlûrte chu inchawih mawi takin an tah a, cherub lem mawi tak tak an zep bawk a; chu chu pindan zârah an hmang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Sitim thing ban pali, rangkachaka luan, a inphunna tûr tangkaraw tlang pali nên an siam bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Biakbûk luhnaa zâr tûr la dumpâwl te, la senduk te, la senlâr te leh la zai sîn thlûr te, inchawih mawi takin an tah a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />a zârna tûr Sitim thing ban panga, thil bahna tûr kâwm nei ṭheuh an siam a, a chhîp chu rangkachakin an tuam a, a puan zârna tûr rangkachak tlâwn an vuah bawk a, a bulṭhut tûr dâr tlang panga an siam bawk a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bezalela chuan Thuthlung Bâwm chu a dung tawng hnih leh a chanve, a vâng tawng khat leh a chanve, a sân lam tawng khat leh a chanve Sitim thingin a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A chhûng lam leh pâwn lam chu rangkachak hlîr hlakin a luan chhuak ve ve a, a kotlângte chu rangkachak phêkin a kâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A zâwnfung rawlhna tûr rangkachak beng pali a chhûng bawk, bâwm sîr lehlam lehlamah chuan pahnih ve vein a vuah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A zâwnfung tûr Sitim thing tlâwnte chu rangkachaka luan bawk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A zâwnfungte chu a sîr lehlam lehlama bengah te chuan a vuah a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />bâwm chhîn tûr, rangkachak hlîr hlakin tawng hnih leh a chanvea sei, tawng khat leh a chanvea hlai a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A chhîn dung lam hmâwr ve ve-ah chuan rangkachaka siam cherub lem a chhera chher a dintîr a, a chhîn nên chuan a inzawm a, sakhat a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cherub-te chuan thla an zâr a, Thuthlung Bâwm chhîn chu an thla chuan a khuh a; inhmatawnin an ding a, a chhîn chu an bih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sitim thing dawhkân, a dung tawng hnih, a vâng tawng khat, tawng khat leh a chanvea sâng a siam bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Rangkachak hlîr hlakin a luan a, a kotlâng chu a vêlin rangkachakin a kâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A tlâng khuahna, rangkachak phêk kutphah bawk, a tlângah lallukhum ang a tlarin a bel chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A zâwnfung rawlhna tûr rangkachak beng pali a chhûng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />dawhkân tlâng tuamna bulah chuan a vuah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A zâwnfung tûr, Sitim thing tlâwn a siam a, rangkachakin a luan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thlêng te, bêl te, uain thâwl te, uain bunna tûr no te, rangkachak hlangin a siam bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Rangkachak hlîr hlakin khâwnvâr dahna zâr sarih nei a chher a, a bulṭhut leh a kûngpui chu rangkachak tlanga chher a ni; a lu bâwk te, a pangpâr kuhmûm lem te, a pâr parh lem te nên chuan an inzawm vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zâr paruk, a kûngpui aṭanga pêng, a sîr lehlam lehlamah pathum ve ve a awm a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />a zâr hmâwr chhîp, a lu chu, theite pâr ang a ni; a sîra kuangah chuan a kuhmûm leh pâr parh lem pathum a awm ṭheuh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A kûng zidingah chuan a lu bâwk a awm a, kuhmûm leh pâr parh pali lem a awm bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A zâr chungnung leh hnuai zâwk inkâr, a kûngpuiah chuan kuhmûm lem a awm zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hêng kuhmûm te, a lu bâwk te, a zârte hi a inzawm vek a, sakhat a ni. Rangkachak hlîr hlak tlang khat aṭanga chher a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A khâwnvâr bûr, a lu bâwk pasarih te, chaicheh te, meivâp dahna te, rangkachak hlîr hlakin a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A khâwnvâr bâwr leh a hmanrua zawng zawng siam nân rangkachak kg. sawmnga vêl an hmang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Sitim thing dawhkân kil li nei, tawng khat bial, tawng hniha sâng a siam bawk a, a kila kite nên chuan a inzawm vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Rangkachak hlangin dawhkân leh a ki chu a luan a, a tlâng chu rangkachakin a tuam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A zâwnfung rawlhna tûr rangkachak beng a chher a, a tlâng kâwmna bul, a sîr tuakah pahnih ve ve a vuah a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A zâwnfung tûr sitim thing tlâwn a siam a, rangkachakin a luan a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hriak thianghlim thih tûr te, rimtui hâl tûr, tel rimtui anga chawhpawlh te a siam bawk a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Thilhlan hâlna tûr maichâm, Sitim thingin a siam bawk a; kil li nei, tawng nga bial, tawng thuma sâng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A kilah ki lawr chho a siam ṭheuh a, maichâm nên chuan an inzawm tlat vek a ni; dârin maichâm leh a ki chu a tuam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />maichâma hman tûr vut bâwm te, vutlawh te, maihûn te, thîrkut kawm te, meilawh te dârin a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Dâr tlâwn ram a tlângah chuan a bel kual a, a maichâm zâtve dâwn lai a awh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zâwnfung rawlhna tûr beng pali a chhûng a, kil tinah a dah thliah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A zâwnfung tûr Sitim thing tlâwn a siam a, dârin a tuam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Maichâm bang sir tuaka bengah chuan zâwnfungte chu a rawlh a. Maichâm chhûng chu a kawrawng, a bang chu thingphel a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Inbiakna bûk kawngka bula rawngbâwl ṭhîn nuhovin dârthlalanga an hman ṭhin dâr tle mi aṭangin dâr chawhtawlh leh a hûnna chu a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />La zai sîna tah puanin Biakbûk chu a hung a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Biakbûk chhim lam hung nân tawng zaa sei puan a hmang a, Ban sawmhnih leh a bulṭhut dâr tlang sawmhnih, thil bahna tûr kawm te, a zâr nâna tangkaraw tlâwn te a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Biakbûk hmâr lamah pawh puan tawng zaa sei, ban sawmhnih, a bulṭhut dâr tlang sawmhnih leh thil inbahna tûr kawm leh tangkaraw tlâwn a siam bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Biakbûk kawmchâr khawthlang lamah chuan puan tawng sawmngaa sei a zâr a, ban sâwm leh a bulṭhut dâr tlang sâwm a siam a, a bana thil kawm leh puan bahna thil tlâwn chu tangkaruaa siam a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khawchhak lam pawh tawng sawmngaa zau a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kawngka zau lam chu tawng sawmhnih a ni a, a sîr tawna zârah puan tawng sâwm leh panga ve ve a hmang a, ban pathum leh a bulṭhut pathum ve ve awmin a siam bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A hungna puanzâr chu la zai sîn thlûra tah vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A ban bulṭhut chu dâr a ni a, a kâwm te, a ngul te, a ban chhîp tuamna te chu tangkarua vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A hungna ban zawng zawng chu tangkaraw tlâwna vuak zawm vek a ni. A kawngka luhnaa puanzâr chu la zai sîn thlûr, a dumpâwl te, a senduk te, a senlâr te inchawih mawi taka tah a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A puanzâr chu tawng sawmhniha sei, tawng ngaa sâng, Biakbûk hungna puanzâr dang ang bawk a ni. Ban pali leh a bulṭhut dâr tlang pali te, a bahna kawm te, a ban lu bâwk te, a vuak zawmna tangkaraw tlâwn te chu tangkarua vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Biakbûk leh a hungna kilh khâwmna chu dâr vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Thupêk Sâwm ziakna lungphêk an dahna Biakbûk chu a sak nân hetiang hi an hmang. Mosia thupêkin puithiam Arona fapa Ithamara hovin Levia chiten a zât hi an chhût chhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Juda hnama mi, Hura tupa Bezalela, Uria fapa chuan Mosia hnêna Lalpa thupêk ang zawng zawng chu a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A thawhpui, Dan hnam, Ahisamaka fapa Oholiaba chu thil ker thiam, thil mawi hria, la zai sîn, a dumpâwl te, a senduk te, a senlâr tea tah pawlh dân hmang hre tak a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Biakbûk thianghlim sak nâna Lalpa hmaa rangkachak an rawn dah chu chutih hun laia khawtlâng hman bûklung dik taka bûkin kg. sângkhat a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chhiarpui an neiha mi tin thawh zât tûr an tuk anga tangkarua an rawn thawh chu khawtlâng hman lai bûklung dik taka bûkin kg. sângthum leh zali leh sawmthum a tling.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hei hi kum sawmhnih tling chin chhiarpuia chhiar tel mi nuairuk leh sângthum leh zanga leh sawmngaten sekel chanve an rawn pêk tluk kha a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Pindan puanzâr ban leh bang thuahna bulṭhut chu pakhat pawh tangkarua kg. sawmthum leh pali-a rit zêl a ni a, a vaiin kg. sângthum leh zali an hmang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />An hman bang tangkarua kg. sawmthum chuan Bezalelan puan zârna tlâwn te, a kawm te, a ban lu tuamna te a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Lalpa tâna dâr an pêk chu kg. sânghnih leh zali leh sawmhnih leh panga a tling a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hei hian Biakbûk hungna ban bul te, maichâma bel te, dâr tlâwn ram te, a bungbêl te, a luhna ban bul te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Biakbûk leh a hungna khen nghehna zawng zawng a siam a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hmun Thianghlima rawng an bâwl huna puithiamho hâk tûr mawi tak leh Arona puithiam kawr serh chu Lalpa thupêk ang chuan la dumpâwl te, a senduk te leh a senlâr tein an siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Efod chu la zai sîn, a dumpâwl te, a senduk te, a senlâr te leh rangkachak zai tein an tah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Rangkachak chu pan takin an chhu pêr a, la zai sîn te, a dumpâwl te, a senduk te, a senlâr te nêna zeh tûrin an zai thlêr seng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Dârbak pahnih an siam a, efod kilah chuan a hmâwr an ṭhui belhbâwm a, chu chuan a man bet a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kâwnga efod hrên behna tûr, efod ang chiah an tah a, Mosia hnênah Lalpa thupêk ang khân efod nên an tah zawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Soham lungmantam chu rangkachakah an phûm a, Jakoba fa sâwm leh pahnih hming chu mawi takin an ker a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpa thupêk ang ngei khân efod dârbakah chuan an vuah a, chu chu Israel hnam sâwm leh pahnih entîrna a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Efod siam nâna an thil hman, la zai sîn thlûr te, a dumpâwl te, a senduk te, a senlâr te leh rangkachak zaite hmangin âwmbel pawh chu inchawih mawi takin an tah bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />An thlep a, thleh hnu chuan kil li nei, khâp khat bial a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lungmantam tlar li an vuah a, tlar khatnaah chuan Odam te, Pitda te, Bareket lung te an dah a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />tlar hnihnaah chuan Nopek te, Safir te, Jahalom lung te an dah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tlar thumnaah chuan Lesem te, Sebo te, Aklama lung te an dah a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />tlar linaah chuan Tarsis te, Soham te, Jaspi lung te an dah a, lungmantam hi rangkachaka phûm tlar ṭhet a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lung pakhatah Israel hnam pakhat hming a chuang zêl a, Israel hnam sâwm leh pahnih aiawh atân tih a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Âwmbel phuar behna tûr rangkachak hlîr hlak khaidiat herh a siam bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lungmantam phûmna rangkachak pahnih leh rangkachak beng pahnih an siam chu âwmbel kil chung lamah an vuah ve ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Rangkachak khaidiat herh chu a bengah chuan an thlung a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />a hmâwr lehlam chu lungmantam phûmna rangkachak pahnih nên an zawm a; tichuan, âwmbel thlunna chu efod dârbak hma lamah a inthlung a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Rangkachak beng dang pahnih an siam a, âwmbel kil hnuai lam, a chhûng lamah, Efod depah an vuah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Rangkachak beng dang pahnih a siam a, efod dârbak bul lam inbelna laia kâwnghrên chungah a vuah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mosia hnêna Lalpa thupêk angin âwmbela rangkachak beng leh efod rangkachak beng chu la dumpâwlin an suih belhbâwm a; tichuan, a kâwnghrên chungah âwmbel chu a bei tlat a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Efod hnuaia kawrfual chu la dumpâwl hlîra tah a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Lu rawlhna tûr a laiah an rek a, a reh tlang chu a ṭeh loh nân puan themin an chep a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A kawrfual tlângah chuan la zai sîn te, a dumpâwl te, a senduk te, a senlâr tea siam theibuhfai lem an khai a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />rangkachak tengeng nên inthlâk chiatin an khai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mosia hnêna Lalpa thupêk angin rawngbâwlnaa hâk atân an siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Arona leh a fate tân kawrhnuai te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />diar te, lukhum te, kekawr tûrte la zai sînin an tah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />La zai sîn thlûr te, a dumpâwl te, a senduk te, a senlâr te inchawih mawi takin kâwnghrên tûr an tah bawk, Mosia hnêna Lalpa thupêk ang khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Rangkachak hlang hlakin lu hrên an siam bawk a; chutah chuan, “ Lalpa Pual” tih an ziak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Diar hma lamah chuan la dumpâwl hrualin Mosia hnêna Lalpa thupêk ang chuan an thlung bet a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Biakbûk leh thil dangte chu an siam zo ta a. Israel fate chuan Mosia hnêna Lalpa thupêk ang zawng zawng kha an ti vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Mosia hnênah Biakbûk siamna tûr siam sa chu an rawn la a; thil kawm te, thingphel rem te, a ban te, a chehna te, a bulṭhut te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />a chung khuhna berâm vun tihsen te, savun ṭha chi te, puan zâr tûr te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Thuthlung Bâwm leh a chhûnga lungphêk te, a zâwnfungte leh a chhîn te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />dawhkân leh a bungrua zawng zawng leh Pathian tâna chhang serh te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />khâwnvâr bâwr, rangkachak hlîr hlaka siam, a chhitna leh a bungraw dang te, a chhit tûr hriak te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />rangkachak maichâm te, thih tûr hriak te, rimtui hâl tûr te, Biakbûk luhna kawngkaa puanzâr tûr te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />dâra tuam maichâm leh a hûnna te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />a hungnaa zâr tûr puan te, bante leh a bulṭhut tûr te, a hung chhûng luhna kawngkaa puanzâr leh a thlunna hrui te; Biakbûk khennghehna leh Biakbûk thuam nâna thil ṭûl zawng zawng te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Hmun Thianghlima puithiamho hâk tûr thawmhnaw mawi tak tak te, puithiam Arona leh a fate kawr serh te chu an rawn la a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Israel fate chuan Mosia hnêna Lalpa thupêk ang chiah khân engkim an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Mosia chuan ngun takin a lo en vek a, Lalpa thupêk ang chiahin an siam tih a hmuh chuan malsâwm tûrin Pathian hnênah a hlân a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Mosia hnênah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Thla hmasa ber, ni khatah Lalpa chênna tûr Biakbûk hi din ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thuthlung Bâwm, thupêk sâwm ziak awmna lungphêk chu a chhûngah dah ula, a pindan chu puan zâr hnan rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Dawhkân chu la lût ula, a bungruate chu a chungah dah ula; khâwnvâr bâwr pawh la lût ula, a dahna tûrah dah rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Rangkachak maichâm, rimtui hâlna tûr chu, Thuthlung Bâwm hmaah dah ula, Biakbûk luhna kawngkaa puan chu zâr rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hâlral hlanna maichâm chu Biakbûk kawtah dah ula,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />maichâm leh Biakbûk inkârah dâr chawhtawlh chu hûng ula, tui dah bawk ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A tual chu hung ula, a luhna kawngka puanzâr pawh zâr rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Biakbûk leh a chhûnga bungrua zawng zawng chu hriak thianghlim chulh la; tichuan, an lo thianghlim ve tawh ang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Maichâm leh a bungbêlah te hriak thianghlim chu chulh bawk la, an lo thianghlim vek tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Insilna dâr chawhtawlh leh a hûnna pawh hriak thianghlim chu hnawihin thian thianghlim ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Arona leh a fate chu Biakbûk hung chhûngah ko lût la, dân angin insil rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Arona chu puithiam thawmhnaw bel la, hriak thih la, puithiam hna thawk tûrin serh hrang rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A fate pawh ko lût la, kawrfual chu hâktîr ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />An pa hriak i thih ang khân anni pawh puithiam hna thawk tûrin hriak thih ang che; hriak thih an nih hnu chuan puithiam an ni kumkhua tawh ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lalpa thupêk ang chiah chuan Mosia chuan a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aigupta an chhuahsan kum hnihna, thla hmasa ber ni khat ni chuan Biakbûk chu a sa fel a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mosia chuan a bulṭhutte chu a hûng a, a bangte chu a tung a, a bangrelte a vuah a, a bante a phun a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Biakbûk chung puan pawh a zâr a, a thuahnate pawh a kaih a. Lalpa thupêk ang khân a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lungphêk pahnih chu Thuthlung Bâwmah a khung a, a zâwnfungte chu a rawlh a, a chhinna chuan a chhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Biakbûk chhûngah Thuthlung Bâwm chu a dah a, pindan puan chu a zâr hnan a, Lalpa thupêk ang zêl chuan a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Biakbûk chhûng, pindan pâwn zâwk hmâr lamah chuan dawhkân chu a hûng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Lalpa thupêk angin a chungah chhang serh chu a dah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chhim lamah khâwnvâr bâwr chu dawhkân epah a hûng bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Lalpa hmaah chuan a thupêk angin khâwnvâr chu a chhi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Rangkachak maichâm chu pindan puanzâr bulah chuan a hûng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Lalpa thupêk angin thil rimtuite chu a hâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Biakbûk luhna kawngka puanzâr chu a zâr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Puanzâr pâwn, Biakbûk tualah chuan, hâlral hlanna maichâm chu a hûng a; chutah chuan hâlral thilhlan leh buhbâl thilhlante chu a hlân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Dâr chawhtawlh leh a hûnna chu Biakbûk leh maichâm inkârah chuan a dah a, tui a chhûng khat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chutah chuan Mosia te, Arona te leh a fate chuan an kut leh ke an sil a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Biakbûk chhûngah emaw, maichâmah emaw an kal dâwn apiangin Lalpa thupêk angin an insil ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Mosia chuan Biakbûk leh maichâm chu a hung kual a, a hung chhûng luhna kawngka puanzâr pawh chu a zâr bawk a. Tih tûr zawng zawng chu a ti zo ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Inbiakna bûk chu chhûm chuan a chîm a, Biakbûk chhûng chu Lalpa ropuinain a khat ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Chuvâng chuan, bûk chhûngah Mosia chu a lût thei lo, Lalpa ropuinain a khat tlat a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Chhûmin Biakbûk chu a kiansan veleh Israel-te chuan an bûk an sawn ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Chhûmin a chîm chhûng chu an insawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Thlalêra an vah chhûng zawng khân Israel-te mit hmuhah Lalpa chhûm chuan chhûnah bûk chu a chîm a, zânah zânkhuain meialh a ni thung a.
  </para>
</usx>
